 OTT 用户是谁？广深占比多少？谁更愿意付费？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：STB 占 MAU 约 62%，Speaker 约 38%；广州+深圳合计约 48%； 点播渗透率 STB 约 72% vs Speaker 约 54%。见 v_user_portrait 与活跃总览看板。", "servesLayers": "L1 描述、L2 诊断、L5 分群", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "lifecycle", "layer": "l6", "category": "用户理解", "title": "生命周期分析", "aliases": "生命周期 / 五阶段 / 用户旅程", "desc": "将用户划分为新注册→激活→活跃→沉默→流失五阶段，跟踪各阶段规模与迁移率，识别增长瓶颈。", "bizQuestion": "用户处在哪个生命周期阶段？净增为什么转负？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：日激活约 85 人，沉默约 1,240 人，周 churn 约 32 人；approx_net_growth 近 7 日均值为正。 见 v_lifecycle 与用户生命周期看板。", "servesLayers": "L1 描述、L2 诊断、L3 预测", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "segment", "layer": "l6", "category": "用户理解", "title": "用户分群分析", "aliases": "分群 / 用户分层 / 状态分群", "desc": "按活跃状态、端型、行为标签等维度将用户划分为可运营的分群，配套差异化策略。", "bizQuestion": "哪些用户群值得重点运营？各群规模多大？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例快照：活跃 / 沉默 / 流失三群规模约 4,200 / 1,240 / 560；双端用户约 10%。 见 v_user_segment 与设备流转看板。", "servesLayers": "L1 描述、L5 优化", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "retention", "layer": "l6", "category": "增长分析", "title": "留存分析", "aliases": "留存 / 同期群 / Cohort / N日留存", "desc": "按首次活跃日期分组，跟踪各 cohort 在 D1/D7/D30 的留存曲线，评估获客质量变化。", "bizQuestion": "新用户留得住吗？哪批 cohort 质量更好？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：某注册 cohort 的 D1 / D7 / D30 留存约 38% / 22% / 14%； STB 的 D7 约 25% vs Speaker 约 16%。见 v_user_retention 与用户留存看板。", "servesLayers": "L2 诊断、L3 预测、L4 评估", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "rfm", "layer": "l6", "category": "增长分析", "title": "RFM 分层分析", "aliases": "RFM / 最近频次金额 / 价值分层", "desc": "以最近活跃（R）、使用频次（F）、订购金额（M）三维将用户分为高价值/潜力/流失风险等层级。", "bizQuestion": "谁值得重点运营？谁需要挽回？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：高价值活跃约 8%，流失风险约 22%； 优先对\\"沉默 >30 天且历史点播 >10 次\\"的用户 push 挽回。见 v_rfm。", "servesLayers": "L2 诊断、L5 挽回", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "funnel", "layer": "l6", "category": "增长分析", "title": "漏斗分析", "aliases": "转化漏斗 / 收银台漏斗 / 步骤流失", "desc": "将曝光→点击→验证→确认绘制为漏斗，分析各步骤留存率与流失率，识别转化瓶颈。", "bizQuestion": "从曝光到订购，哪一步流失最多？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例收银台：launcher 曝光→点击约 25%、点击→验证约 80%、验证→确认约 20%； video 点击→验证约 45%（误触偏高）。见 v_funnel 与商业化漏斗看板。", "servesLayers": "L2 诊断、L4 评估", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "ltv", "layer": "l6", "category": "增长分析", "title": "LTV 分析", "aliases": "LTV / 终身价值 / LTV/CAC / ARPU", "desc": "估算用户在整个生命周期内的订购金额与分成贡献，并与获客成本（CAC）对比评估长期 ROI。", "bizQuestion": "用户长期值多少钱？投放回本了吗？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：launcher LTV 约 15.2 元、CAC 约 8.5 元（LTV/CAC≈1.8）； video LTV 约 12.8 元、CAC 约 11.2 元（LTV/CAC≈1.1）。见 v_ltv 与 v_channel_analysis。", "servesLayers": "L3 预测、L4 评估、L5 优化", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "northstar", "layer": "l6", "category": "增长分析", "title": "北极星指标拆解", "aliases": "北极星 / 指标拆解 / OKR 树", "desc": "将核心北极星指标（如有效 MAU）拆解为 DAU、端型渗透、功能使用、留存等子指标，定位驱动因素。", "bizQuestion": "有效 MAU 怎么拆？增长靠哪个子指标？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：有效 MAU 约 4,800（STB + Speaker 分端型之和需与全局去重对账）； 驱动指标：点播渗透、直播渗透、只开机占比（需压降）。见 v_dau_overview 与活跃总览看板。", "servesLayers": "L1 描述、L5 目标对齐", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "attribution", "layer": "l6", "category": "归因与实验", "title": "渠道归因分析", "aliases": "归因 / 末次点击 / 线性归因 / 时间衰减", "desc": "将订购转化归功于 launcher/video 等入口触点，支持末次点击、线性分配、时间衰减等多种归因模型。", "bizQuestion": "这笔订购应该归功于哪个入口？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例末次归因：launcher 约 62% 订购、video 约 38%； 线性模型 launcher 约 58%。见 v_channel_attribution。", "servesLayers": "L2 诊断、L4 评估、L5 预算", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "ab", "layer": "l6", "category": "归因与实验", "title": "A/B 测试分析", "aliases": "A/B 测试 / 实验 / 显著性检验", "desc": "对比实验组与对照组的核心指标（CTR/CVR/留存），通过样本量与 p 值判断改版是否显著有效。", "bizQuestion": "收银台改版有没有效？能否全量？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）launcher 引导实验示例：treatment CVR 约 18.2% vs control 约 15.8%（+2.4pct，样本约 3,200，p<0.05）， 建议全量。见 v_ab_experiment。", "servesLayers": "L4 评估、L5 验证", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "experiment-design", "layer": "l6", "category": "归因与实验", "title": "增长实验设计", "aliases": "实验设计 / 假设验证 / 最小可行实验", "desc": "从业务假设出发，设计对照实验的样本量、周期、核心指标与成功标准，避免无效实验。", "bizQuestion": "下一个实验该怎么设计？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）假设「video 入口减少误触可提升验证率 5pct」：需每组样本约 2,000+，周期约 14 天， 核心指标 click→verify，成功标准 +3pct 且 p<0.05。参考 v_ab_experiment 历史口径。", "servesLayers": "L4 评估前置、L5 方案验证", "has_sql": false, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "churn", "layer": "l6", "category": "运营优化", "title": "流失预警分析", "aliases": "流失预警 / 沉默监控 / Churn Score", "desc": "基于沉默天数、只开机行为、播放衰减等信号，对即将流失的用户进行评分与预警。", "bizQuestion": "谁即将流失？规模多大？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例：沉默 >30 天约 1,240 人，其中只开机无点播约 680 人（最高风险）； 建议分 3 批 push + 内容券触达，并保留 10% 不触达对照以评估挽回效果。 见 v_rfm 与 v_user_segment。", "servesLayers": "L2 诊断、L3 预测、L5 挽回", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "marginal-roi", "layer": "l6", "category": "运营优化", "title": "边际 ROI 分析", "aliases": "边际 ROI / 增量收益 / 预算边际", "desc": "评估每增加一单位入口流量/投放预算带来的增量订购与分成，识别收益递减拐点。", "bizQuestion": "再加投 10% 流量，还能赚多少？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）launcher 示例：前 60% 流量 ROI 约 2.1，60–80% 降至约 1.4，>80% 仅约 0.9（边际递减）； 建议流量上限设在 75% 附近。见 v_channel_analysis 日粒度拆解。", "servesLayers": "L5 优化", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "channel-scorecard", "layer": "l6", "category": "运营优化", "title": "渠道质量评分卡", "aliases": "渠道评分卡 / 入口质量 / 渠道 KPI", "desc": "将 CAC、LTV、留存、转化率、分成 ROI 等指标加权汇总为渠道综合评分，支持投放决策。", "bizQuestion": "各入口综合质量如何排名？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例评分卡：launcher 综合分较高（LTV/CAC≈1.8、D7 留存≈25%）； video 综合分较低（误触偏高、LTV/CAC≈1.1）。见 v_channel_analysis + v_ltv 综合。", "servesLayers": "L4 评估、L5 优化", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}, {"id": "path", "layer": "l6", "category": "运营优化", "title": "行为路径分析", "aliases": "行为路径 / 用户旅程 / 序列分析", "desc": "追踪用户从开机→点播/直播→收银台→订购的行为序列，识别高频路径与流失节点。", "bizQuestion": "用户典型路径是什么？在哪一步离开？", "portfolio": "（示例值，非真实基准）2026-07 示例典型路径：开机 → 点播 → 剧集详情 → 收银台曝光 → 确认； 最大流失在\\"详情 → 收银台\\"这一步。见 dws_act_user_active_1d + dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d。", "servesLayers": "L2 诊断、L4 评估", "has_sql": true, "has_judge": true}], "method_count": 15}, "playbooks": [{"id": "q01", "layer": "l1", "category": "活跃概况类", "title": "DAU/MAU 趋势总览", "desc": "掌握 OTT 整体活跃水位、端型结构与月度波动；含可执行7日移动环比；日粒度只开机占比与 q04 月粒度严格口径不可直接对比", "bizQuestion": "这个月日活和月活怎么样？端型结构有没有异常变化？", "keywords": ["DAU", "MAU", "日活", "月活", "STB", "Speaker", "只开机", "7日环比"], "triggers": ["每周增长例会前需准备活跃简报", "管理层询问「最近用户还活跃吗」", "暑期档/版本发布后需复盘活跃变化", "大版本灰度后需核对埋点是否正常"], "criteria": [{"dim": "DAU 7日环比降幅", "ok": "≤10%", "warn": "单日>10%", "bad": "连续7日>10% → L2 DAU下滑诊断"}, {"dim": "只开机占比(日粒度)", "ok": "≤35%", "warn": "逐周上升", "bad": ">35% 持续上升 → q04（勿与月严格口径直接比）"}, {"dim": "DAU/MAU 比值", "ok": "稳定", "warn": "MAU增DAU不增", "bad": "比值明显下降 → q05"}], "steps": [{"title": "数据质量前置（行数检查）", "desc": "分析前先确认 v_dau_overview 日期覆盖完整；某日 row_cnt 异常低或为 0 时先联系数据团队补数。", "sql": "SELECT snapshot_date, COUNT(*) AS row_cnt\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY snapshot_date\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "judge": "存在缺口日或全日为 0 → 停止出结论，先补数", "output": "数据质量检查清单"}, {"title": "DAU 趋势与结构", "desc": "口径 K01。取数范围需比分析范围前推 7 天以便算环比。only_launcher_pct 为日粒度，与 q04 月只开机严格口径不可直接对比。", "sql": "SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau, dau_stb, dau_speaker,\\n  vod_active, live_active, only_launcher,\\n  ROUND(only_launcher / NULLIF(total_dau, 0) * 100, 2) AS only_launcher_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:start_date, INTERVAL 7 DAY) AND :end_date\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "judge": "先看结构与只开机日占比；环比见下一步。only_launcher_pct 逐周上升且>35%同步标注「只开机占比异常(日粒度)」。", "output": "DAU 折线图（STB/Speaker + only_launcher 副轴）"}, {"title": "7 日移动环比（可执行）", "desc": "wow_pct=(当日DAU-7日前DAU)/7日前DAU；起始日须前推7天。", "sql": "WITH d AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau,\\n    LAG(total_dau, 7) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date) AS dau_7d_ago\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:start_date, INTERVAL 7 DAY) AND :end_date\\n)\\nSELECT snapshot_date, total_dau, dau_7d_ago,\\n  ROUND((total_dau - dau_7d_ago) / NULLIF(dau_7d_ago, 0) * 100, 2) AS wow_pct,\\n  CASE WHEN (total_dau - dau_7d_ago) / NULLIF(dau_7d_ago, 0) < -0.10 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS flag_drop\\nFROM d\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :start_date AND :end_date\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "judge": "flag_drop 连续7日为1 → 标注「DAU异常下滑」，产出须列出连续下滑起止日期", "output": "7日环比表 + 连续下滑区间清单"}, {"title": "MAU 端型对比（全局去重）", "desc": "口径 K02。合计须全局 COUNT(DISTINCT mac)；分行之和≠合计时差额为跨端用户。", "sql": "SELECT device_type, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS mau\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY device_type\\nUNION ALL\\nSELECT ''合计（全局去重）'', COUNT(DISTINCT mac)\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end;\\n\\n-- 方式B：跨端用户数\\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS cross_device_mac_cnt FROM (\\n  SELECT mac FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY mac HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT device_type) > 1\\n) t;", "judge": "若 分行之和-全局合计 >合计的5%，跨端占比高，端型归属可能重叠", "output": "MAU 端型对比表（含跨端脚注）"}], "outputs": ["DAU/MAU 周报一页纸（含口径脚注 K01/K02）", "7日环比与异常日期清单", "数据质量说明"], "nextSteps": ["DAU 7日环比降>10%且已排除数据问题 → 「DAU 下滑诊断」", "only_launcher_pct(日)>35%且持续上升 → 「产品功能使用」(用q04月严格口径复核)", "MAU 增长但 DAU 不增（DAU/MAU 下降） → 「活跃结构分析」"], "dashboards": ["活跃总览", "overview", "v_dau_overview"]}, {"id": "q02", "layer": "l1", "category": "用户结构类", "title": "用户画像（端/地市）", "desc": "端型×地市×付费切片；活跃=MAC(K01)、付费=userid(K03)，禁止混用相除/相乘估算未付费人数", "bizQuestion": "核心用户是谁？广深与 STB/Speaker 各占多少？谁活跃但不付费？", "keywords": ["画像", "端型", "地市", "STB", "Speaker", "付费率", "口径"], "triggers": ["制定区域运营策略前", "端型改版需确认目标用户", "付费率偏低需定位人群", "面试被问「怎么拆用户画像」"], "criteria": [{"dim": "广深活跃占比", "ok": "≥40%", "warn": "接近40%或「未知」地市升", "bad": "<40% → 单列说明并查渠道"}, {"dim": "高活低付费切片", "ok": "无明显大盘", "warn": "付费率<8%且MAC≥1000", "bad": "进入付费转化诊断（不估算未付费MAC）"}], "steps": [{"title": "先写问题卡（停用条件）", "desc": "决策=投放加码/端型改版/区域运营/付费转化；人群口径：活跃=K01、付费=K03、地市=K07；成功标准可量化。写不清或未区分 MAC/userid → 停止。", "judge": "问题卡缺「决策」或口径未区分 → 停", "output": "问题卡：决策 / 人群口径 / 成功标准"}, {"title": "端型×地市分布（分列标注口径）", "desc": "user_count=活跃 MAC，paid_*=userid；禁止把付费率当「活跃MAC付费率」。", "sql": "SELECT device_type, city_tier,\\n  user_count AS active_mac_cnt,\\n  paid_count AS paid_userid_cnt,\\n  paid_rate_pct,\\n  CONCAT(''活跃口径=MAC；付费口径=userid'') AS caliber_note\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_user_portrait\\nWHERE snapshot_date = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_user_portrait)\\nORDER BY active_mac_cnt DESC;", "output": "端型×地市柱状图 + 付费率热力（含口径脚注）"}, {"title": "地市活跃占比与核心城验证", "desc": "口径 K01+K07。空值记「未知」单独列示。", "sql": "SELECT IFNULL(r.region_name, ''未知'') AS region_name,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT a.mac) AS uv,\\n  ROUND(COUNT(DISTINCT a.mac) / SUM(COUNT(DISTINCT a.mac)) OVER() * 100, 2) AS share_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d a\\nLEFT JOIN internet_analytics.dim_region r ON a.region_id = r.region_id\\nWHERE a.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY IFNULL(r.region_name, ''未知'')\\nORDER BY uv DESC;", "judge": "广深合计占比 <40% → 报告单列「核心地市占比变化」", "output": "地市占比饼图 / 排名表"}, {"title": "高活跃低付费切片（不分口径估算）", "desc": "只列活跃 MAC 规模与付费率作参考；不提供未付费人数估算（MAC×userid付费率不成立）。", "sql": "SELECT device_type, city_tier,\\n  user_count AS active_mac_cnt,\\n  paid_count AS paid_userid_cnt,\\n  paid_rate_pct,\\n  CONCAT(''活跃口径=MAC；付费口径=userid；两者不可相乘'') AS caliber_note\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_user_portrait\\nWHERE snapshot_date = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_user_portrait)\\n  AND user_count >= 1000 AND paid_rate_pct < 8\\nORDER BY user_count DESC\\nLIMIT 20;", "judge": "付费率 <8% 且活跃 MAC≥1000 → 列入待攻坚（以 active_mac_cnt 作规模上限参考）", "output": "待攻坚人群清单 Top20（无未付费人数估算）"}, {"title": "沉淀结论与动作", "desc": "事实→含义→动作；报告须含口径脚注与触发阈值。", "output": "一页纸画像结论 + 下一跳"}], "outputs": ["用户画像报告（含 K01/K03/K07 口径）", "区域/端型运营建议", "待攻坚人群清单"], "nextSteps": ["某地市活跃占比环比降>20% → 「渠道获客分布」", "Speaker 付费率 < STB 付费率的 50% → 「付费转化下降诊断」", "该地市/端型只开机>35% → 「产品功能使用」"], "dashboards": ["活跃总览", "overview", "v_user_portrait", "用户标签画像", "tags"]}, {"id": "q03", "layer": "l1", "category": "渠道获客类", "title": "渠道获客分布（入口 launcher/video）", "desc": "入口结构+质量；新老拆分须先确认 is_first_order 存在且为全平台首购口径，否则跳过并注明", "bizQuestion": "用户主要从哪个入口来？入口质量如何？", "keywords": ["渠道", "获客", "launcher", "video", "客单价", "新老", "首购"], "triggers": ["月度投放复盘", "新增订购结构突变", "入口改版效果初评"], "criteria": [{"dim": "入口客单价环比", "ok": "稳定", "warn": "降幅接近15%", "bad": "环比降>15% → L2 CAC诊断"}, {"dim": "新订单占比", "ok": "≥20%且样本量足", "warn": "偏低", "bad": "<20%且total_orders足够大 → L2"}], "steps": [{"title": "入口订购量与金额占比", "desc": "同时看 order_share 与 amount_share。", "sql": "SELECT touch_point,\\n  SUM(attributed_orders) AS orders,\\n  SUM(attributed_amount) AS amount,\\n  ROUND(SUM(attributed_orders) / SUM(SUM(attributed_orders)) OVER() * 100, 2) AS order_share_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(attributed_amount) / SUM(SUM(attributed_amount)) OVER() * 100, 2) AS amount_share_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_channel_attribution\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY touch_point\\nORDER BY orders DESC;", "output": "入口来源堆叠图（量+金额）"}, {"title": "入口×端型/地市交叉（质量）", "desc": "比较 avg_order_value；视图无 region_id 则退化为入口×端型。", "sql": "SELECT touch_point, device_type,\\n  IFNULL(r.region_name, ''未知'') AS region_name,\\n  SUM(attributed_orders) AS orders,\\n  ROUND(SUM(attributed_amount) / NULLIF(SUM(attributed_orders), 0), 2) AS avg_order_value\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_channel_attribution c\\nLEFT JOIN internet_analytics.dim_region r ON c.region_id = r.region_id\\nWHERE c.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY touch_point, device_type, IFNULL(r.region_name, ''未知'')\\nORDER BY orders DESC;", "judge": "切片客单价显著偏低 → 质量待查", "output": "入口×端型×地市质量矩阵"}, {"title": "新老用户拆分（前置确认）", "desc": "前置：①是否有 is_first_order；②口径须为全平台首购（入口首购≠平台新客）；③new_order_pct分母=该入口全部订单。字段缺失则跳过并注明；可用 dws_channel_new_user_1d 近似但须声明不完全可比。", "sql": "-- 口径：is_first_order=1 表示全平台首购；分母为该入口全部订单\\nSELECT touch_point,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN is_first_order = 1 THEN attributed_orders ELSE 0 END) AS new_orders,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN is_first_order = 0 THEN attributed_orders ELSE 0 END) AS repeat_orders,\\n  SUM(attributed_orders) AS total_orders,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN is_first_order = 1 THEN attributed_orders ELSE 0 END)\\n    / NULLIF(SUM(attributed_orders), 0) * 100, 2) AS new_order_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_channel_attribution\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY touch_point;", "judge": "new_order_pct<20% 且 total_orders 足够大 → 获客能力弱；新占比高但客单价低 → 转 L2 渠道质量", "output": "新老订单拆分表（或缺字段说明）"}], "outputs": ["渠道获客结构图", "入口质量矩阵", "新老订单拆分表"], "nextSteps": ["某入口 avg_order_value 环比降>15% → 「CAC/获客效率上升诊断」", "某入口新订单占比<20%且total_orders足够大 → 「渠道质量下降诊断」", "某地市单入口订单集中度>60% → 回「用户画像」"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "v_channel_attribution"]}, {"id": "q04", "layer": "l1", "category": "产品使用类", "title": "产品功能使用（点播/直播/开机）", "desc": "功能渗透按月去重 MAC(K05)；月只开机=严格口径 MIN=1；端型对比按 MAC×端型分别计入（跨端两端各计一次）", "bizQuestion": "用户在产品里做什么？功能使用深度如何？", "keywords": ["点播", "直播", "开机", "功能渗透", "只开机", "严格口径"], "triggers": ["版本迭代评审", "某功能渗透率异常", "只开机用户占比上升"], "criteria": [{"dim": "只开机月占比(严格)", "ok": "≤35%", "warn": "接近35%", "bad": ">35% → 流失诊断"}, {"dim": "点播月活渗透", "ok": "约74%–81%", "warn": "<70%", "bad": "显著低于行业下限 → q06"}], "steps": [{"title": "功能渗透率（用户月粒度 + 严格只开机）", "desc": "渗透：MAX(行为标记)/月活MAC。月只开机=MIN(is_only_launcher)=1（月内每天都只开机），避免偶发只开机误报流失风险。", "sql": "WITH user_month AS (\\n  SELECT mac,\\n    MAX(IFNULL(device_type, ''未知'')) AS device_type,\\n    MAX(is_vod_active) AS is_vod_user,\\n    MAX(is_live_active) AS is_live_user,\\n    MIN(is_only_launcher) AS is_only_launcher_user,\\n    AVG(vod_play_cnt) AS avg_daily_vod_cnt,\\n    SUM(vod_play_dur) AS monthly_vod_dur_sec\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY mac\\n)\\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS monthly_active_mac,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_vod_user) / COUNT(*) * 100, 2) AS vod_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_live_user) / COUNT(*) * 100, 2) AS live_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_only_launcher_user) / COUNT(*) * 100, 2) AS only_launcher_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(avg_daily_vod_cnt), 2) AS avg_daily_vod_play_cnt,\\n  ROUND(AVG(monthly_vod_dur_sec) / 60, 1) AS avg_monthly_vod_minutes\\nFROM user_month;", "judge": "only_launcher_pct>35%（严格口径）标注流失风险；点播渗透<70%需关注。与 q01 日粒度只开机不可直接对比。", "output": "功能渗透 KPI（脚注：月只开机=严格MIN=1）"}, {"title": "端型功能差异（MAC×端型）", "desc": "按 mac,device_type 分别去重；跨端用户两端各计一次。分端型之和可能>全局去重 MAU。端型空值=未知。", "sql": "WITH user_month_device AS (\\n  SELECT mac, IFNULL(device_type, ''未知'') AS device_type,\\n    MAX(is_vod_active) AS is_vod_user,\\n    MAX(is_live_active) AS is_live_user,\\n    SUM(vod_play_dur) AS monthly_vod_dur_sec\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY mac, IFNULL(device_type, ''未知'')\\n)\\nSELECT device_type, COUNT(*) AS active_mac,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_vod_user) / COUNT(*) * 100, 2) AS vod_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_live_user) / COUNT(*) * 100, 2) AS live_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(monthly_vod_dur_sec) / 60, 1) AS avg_monthly_vod_minutes\\nFROM user_month_device\\nGROUP BY device_type;", "judge": "Speaker 点播渗透显著低于 STB → 端型功能适配问题（转 L2）", "output": "端型功能对比表（脚注：跨端两端各计一次）"}], "outputs": ["功能渗透报告（K05+严格只开机）", "端型差异说明（MAC×端型口径）"], "nextSteps": ["vod_penetration_pct <70% → 「内容题材分布」", "only_launcher_pct>35%（严格） → 「用户流失诊断」", "Speaker 点播渗透显著低于 STB → 端型功能适配诊断（L2）"], "dashboards": ["开机活跃", "launcher", "点播活跃", "vod", "直播活跃", "live"]}, {"id": "q05", "layer": "l1", "category": "活跃概况类", "title": "活跃结构分析", "desc": "高/中/低活跃、沉默与流失结构；必须对账 v_user_segment vs 当月活跃 MAC，差异>5%单列说明", "bizQuestion": "活跃用户结构健康吗？沉默与流失占比是否上升？", "keywords": ["活跃结构", "沉默", "流失", "分群", "口径对账"], "triggers": ["月活增长但有效活跃停滞", "沉默用户占比上升", "生命周期净增转负"], "criteria": [{"dim": "沉默占比环比", "ok": "稳定", "warn": "升幅接近5pp", "bad": "环比升>5pp → 流失诊断"}, {"dim": "seg vs 活跃MAC差", "ok": "|diff|≤5%", "warn": "接近5%", "bad": ">5% 须单列口径差异说明"}], "steps": [{"title": "用户状态分布", "desc": "最新快照活跃/沉默/流失结构。", "sql": "SELECT segment_name, user_count,\\n  ROUND(user_count / SUM(user_count) OVER() * 100, 2) AS share_pct,\\n  avg_days_since_active\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_user_segment\\nWHERE snapshot_date = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_user_segment)\\nORDER BY user_count DESC;", "output": "活跃结构饼图"}, {"title": "口径对账（seg vs 当月活跃 MAC）", "desc": "diff_pct 绝对值>5% → 单列口径差异说明，差异未说明前结构结论标「口径待对账」。", "sql": "WITH seg AS (\\n  SELECT SUM(user_count) AS seg_total_users\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_user_segment\\n  WHERE snapshot_date = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_user_segment)\\n),\\nact AS (\\n  SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS active_mac_mtd\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n)\\nSELECT seg.seg_total_users, act.active_mac_mtd,\\n  ROUND((seg.seg_total_users - act.active_mac_mtd) / NULLIF(act.active_mac_mtd, 0) * 100, 2) AS diff_pct\\nFROM seg CROSS JOIN act;", "judge": "|diff_pct|>5% → 写明 v_user_segment 口径(MAC/userid)、是否含历史累计、差异来源", "output": "口径对账表（seg_total_users / active_mac_mtd / diff_pct）"}, {"title": "生命周期净增趋势", "desc": "approx_net_growth 口径未文档化则不作结论性判断。", "sql": "SELECT snapshot_date, new_register, new_activate, silent_cnt, churn_cnt,\\n  active_users, approx_net_growth\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_lifecycle\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "judge": "approx_net_growth 连续7日<0 → 标注；先确认近似来源", "output": "生命周期趋势折线"}], "outputs": ["活跃结构报告", "口径对账表", "净增趋势图"], "nextSteps": ["沉默用户占比环比升>5pp → 「用户流失诊断」", "new_activate 连续7日下降 → 「留存下降诊断」", "活跃中只开机占比同步上升 → 「产品功能使用」"], "dashboards": ["用户生命周期", "lifecycle", "v_user_segment", "v_lifecycle"]}, {"id": "q06", "layer": "l1", "category": "内容分析类", "title": "内容题材分布", "desc": "题材 VV/UV 与加权完播(K06)；完播异常判定=题材加权完播不足同品类加权均值一半（pct_of_category_avg<50）", "bizQuestion": "用户在看什么内容？哪些题材/品类表现好？", "keywords": ["题材", "剧集", "VV", "完播率", "品类", "加权完播"], "triggers": ["内容运营排期前", "某题材完播率异常", "暑期档内容策略调整"], "criteria": [{"dim": "题材完播/品类均值", "ok": "接近100%", "warn": "偏低", "bad": "pct_of_category_avg<50且VV足够大 → L2"}], "steps": [{"title": "题材 VV/UV 排行（加权完播）", "desc": "注明完播口径为加权完播率。", "sql": "SELECT g.genre_name,\\n  SUM(s.vv) AS total_vv, SUM(s.uv) AS total_uv,\\n  SUM(s.finish_cnt) AS total_finish,\\n  ROUND(SUM(s.finish_cnt) / NULLIF(SUM(s.vv), 0) * 100, 2) AS weighted_finish_rate_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_genre g ON s.genre_id = g.genre_id\\nWHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY g.genre_name\\nORDER BY total_vv DESC;", "judge": "标注 K06；未映射 genre_id 计入「未分类」", "output": "题材播放排行表"}, {"title": "题材完播 vs 同品类加权均值", "desc": "同品类均值=同 category 下加权完播（Σfinish/Σvv）；pct_of_category_avg=题材完播/品类均值×100。", "sql": "WITH genre_stat AS (\\n  SELECT g.genre_name, c.category_name,\\n    SUM(s.vv) AS total_vv, SUM(s.finish_cnt) AS total_finish,\\n    ROUND(SUM(s.finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(s.vv),0)*100,2) AS weighted_finish_rate_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\n  JOIN internet_analytics.dim_genre g ON s.genre_id=g.genre_id\\n  JOIN internet_analytics.dim_category c ON s.category_id=c.category_id\\n  WHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY g.genre_name, c.category_name\\n),\\ncategory_avg AS (\\n  SELECT category_name,\\n    ROUND(SUM(total_finish)/NULLIF(SUM(total_vv),0)*100,2) AS category_weighted_finish_pct\\n  FROM genre_stat GROUP BY category_name\\n)\\nSELECT gs.genre_name, gs.category_name, gs.total_vv, gs.weighted_finish_rate_pct,\\n  ca.category_weighted_finish_pct,\\n  ROUND(gs.weighted_finish_rate_pct/NULLIF(ca.category_weighted_finish_pct,0)*100,2) AS pct_of_category_avg\\nFROM genre_stat gs\\nJOIN category_avg ca ON gs.category_name=ca.category_name\\nORDER BY gs.total_vv DESC;", "judge": "pct_of_category_avg<50（不足同品类加权均值一半）且 total_vv 足够大 → 转 L2 完播率异常诊断", "output": "题材 vs 品类完播对照表"}, {"title": "品类渗透（排期决策）", "desc": "品类 VV 占比显著偏离时在排期建议中标注。", "sql": "SELECT c.category_name, SUM(s.vv) AS vv, SUM(s.uv) AS uv,\\n  ROUND(SUM(s.vv) / SUM(SUM(s.vv)) OVER() * 100, 2) AS vv_share_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_category c ON s.category_id = c.category_id\\nWHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY c.category_name\\nORDER BY vv DESC;", "output": "品类渗透饼图"}], "outputs": ["内容题材分布报告", "题材 vs 品类完播对照", "排期建议清单"], "nextSteps": ["某题材加权完播不足同品类加权均值一半（pct_of_category_avg<50）且VV足够大 → 「完播率异常诊断」", "电视剧/综艺 VV 占比下降且 only_launcher 上升 → 回「产品功能使用」"], "dashboards": ["内容·剧集", "series", "dws_content_series_play_1d"]}, {"id": "q07", "layer": "l2", "category": "活跃异常类", "title": "DAU 下滑诊断", "desc": "用区间降幅（K08）拆端型/地市/功能渗透；禁止用 LAG 日差冒充两周降幅", "bizQuestion": "为什么日活下降了？是端型、地市还是功能渗透导致？", "keywords": ["DAU", "下滑", "诊断", "端型", "地市", "区间降幅"], "triggers": ["DAU 连续 7 日环比降幅 >10%", "大促后活跃未回补", "某端型 DAU 骤降"], "criteria": [{"dim": "单端型14日区间降幅", "ok": "≥-15%", "warn": "接近-15%", "bad": "<-15% → 首要怀疑"}, {"dim": "地市区间降幅", "ok": "≥-20% 或占比小", "warn": "降幅大但量小", "bad": "<-20% 且占全量>5%"}, {"dim": "只开机占比", "ok": "≤35% 平稳", "warn": "上升", "bad": ">35% 持续升 → q11"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：数据质量/口径/基线", "desc": "查目标月每日行数；确认埋点/端型/地市口径与大版本灰度；声明基线类型（K09 A/B/C）。缺数或口径变更须先写外生因素。", "sql": "SELECT snapshot_date, COUNT(*) AS row_cnt\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY snapshot_date\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "judge": "某日 row_cnt=0 或显著低于前后日（如<50%）→ 停诊，先补数", "output": "数据质量 + 外生因素 + 基线声明"}, {"title": "端型 DAU 区间降幅（K08）", "desc": "近14天均值 vs 前14天均值的相对变化；禁止 LAG 日差冒充两周降幅。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, ''STB'' AS device_type, dau_stb AS dau\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND :as_of\\n  UNION ALL\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, ''Speaker'', dau_speaker\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND :as_of\\n)\\nSELECT device_type,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 13 DAY) THEN dau END), 0) AS dau_last14_avg,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 14 DAY) THEN dau END), 0) AS dau_prev14_avg,\\n  ROUND(\\n    (AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 13 DAY) THEN dau END)\\n   - AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 14 DAY) THEN dau END))\\n   / NULLIF(AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 14 DAY) THEN dau END), 0) * 100, 2) AS interval_change_pct\\nFROM daily\\nGROUP BY device_type;", "judge": "单端型 interval_change_pct < -15% → 首要怀疑对象", "output": "端型区间降幅表（含 last14/prev14 均值）"}, {"title": "地市维度拆解", "desc": "按地市算区间降幅；原标题含地市但无 SQL。", "sql": "WITH daily_city AS (\\n  SELECT a.snapshot_date, IFNULL(r.region_name, ''未知'') AS region_name, COUNT(DISTINCT a.mac) AS dau\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d a\\n  LEFT JOIN internet_analytics.dim_region r ON a.region_id = r.region_id\\n  WHERE a.snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND :as_of\\n  GROUP BY a.snapshot_date, IFNULL(r.region_name, ''未知'')\\n)\\nSELECT region_name,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 13 DAY) THEN dau END), 0) AS last14_avg,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 14 DAY) THEN dau END), 0) AS prev14_avg,\\n  ROUND(\\n    (AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 13 DAY) THEN dau END)\\n   - AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 14 DAY) THEN dau END))\\n   / NULLIF(AVG(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 14 DAY) THEN dau END), 0) * 100, 2) AS interval_change_pct\\nFROM daily_city\\nGROUP BY region_name\\nORDER BY interval_change_pct ASC;", "judge": "地市区间降幅<-20% 且绝对量占全量>5% → 地市主因嫌疑", "output": "地市区间降幅排序表"}, {"title": "功能渗透变化", "desc": "区分「DAU 降」与「只开机升」。", "sql": "SELECT snapshot_date,\\n  ROUND(vod_active / NULLIF(total_dau, 0) * 100, 2) AS vod_pct,\\n  ROUND(live_active / NULLIF(total_dau, 0) * 100, 2) AS live_pct,\\n  ROUND(only_launcher / NULLIF(total_dau, 0) * 100, 2) AS only_launcher_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 27 DAY) AND :as_of\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "judge": "only_launcher↑且vod↓ → 功能侧，转 L1 q04 再转 q11；only_launcher 平稳但 DAU 降 → 设备侧，转设备流转看板", "output": "功能渗透变化表"}], "outputs": ["DAU 下滑根因报告（含前置三件事、端型/地市/功能、基线声明）", "优先排查清单（按降幅绝对值排序）"], "nextSteps": ["单端型区间降幅>15%且排除缺数 → 「设备流转」看板", "某地市区间降幅>20%且占比>5% → 「渠道获客分布」", "only_launcher_pct>35%且持续上升 → 「用户流失诊断」", "三组拆解均无显著变化 → 回前置2排查口径/灰度"], "dashboards": ["活跃总览", "overview", "设备流转", "device"]}, {"id": "q08", "layer": "l2", "category": "留存异常类", "title": "留存下降诊断", "desc": "D7 相对基线 diff；拆端型×版本×渠道；先排除 cohort 结构变化", "bizQuestion": "为什么留存变差了？是端型、版本还是渠道导致？", "keywords": ["留存", "D7", "同期群", "cohort", "版本", "基线"], "triggers": ["D7 留存连续两周下滑", "新版本上线后留存异动", "Speaker 端留存显著低于 STB"], "criteria": [{"dim": "D7 相对基线", "ok": "diff≥-5pct", "warn": "接近-5pct", "bad": "diff<-5pct → 渠道留存异常"}, {"dim": "端型 D7 差", "ok": "≤10pct", "warn": "接近10pct", "bad": ">10pct → 端型嫌疑"}, {"dim": "版本 D7 差", "ok": "≤8pct", "warn": "接近8pct", "bad": ">8pct → 版本嫌疑"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：cohort 结构检查", "desc": "新客占比/渠道结构变化会导致整体留存率「假恶化」。", "sql": "SELECT cohort_date, channel_code, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS cohort_size\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_user_retention\\nWHERE cohort_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 90 DAY)\\nGROUP BY cohort_date, channel_code;", "judge": "结构同步大变 → 先写结构变化说明，不直接下留存恶化结论", "output": "cohort 结构表"}, {"title": "留存基线对照（K09）", "desc": "当期 D7 vs 近3月基线。", "sql": "WITH base AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, AVG(retention_rate) AS baseline_d7\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_user_retention\\n  WHERE day_offset = 7\\n    AND cohort_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n  GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\ncur AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, AVG(retention_rate) AS cur_d7\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_user_retention\\n  WHERE day_offset = 7 AND cohort_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT c.channel_code, c.cur_d7, b.baseline_d7, ROUND(c.cur_d7 - b.baseline_d7, 2) AS diff_pct\\nFROM cur c LEFT JOIN base b ON c.channel_code = b.channel_code\\nORDER BY diff_pct ASC;", "judge": "diff_pct < -5pct → 该渠道留存异常", "output": "渠道 D7 vs 基线对照表"}, {"title": "端型×版本×渠道拆解", "desc": "若无 app_version 字段不得下版本结论。", "sql": "SELECT retention_bucket, device_type,\\n  IFNULL(app_version, ''未知'') AS app_version,\\n  IFNULL(channel_code, ''未知'') AS channel_code,\\n  ROUND(AVG(retention_rate), 2) AS avg_rate, COUNT(*) AS sample_cnt\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_retention_decomposition\\nWHERE cohort_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY retention_bucket, device_type, IFNULL(app_version, ''未知''), IFNULL(channel_code, ''未知'')\\nORDER BY retention_bucket, avg_rate ASC;", "judge": "端型差>10pct→端型嫌疑；版本差>8pct→版本嫌疑；渠道差>10pct→渠道嫌疑", "output": "疑似端型/版本/渠道清单"}], "outputs": ["留存诊断结论（含结构说明、基线声明、三组嫌疑排序）", "疑似端型/版本/渠道清单"], "nextSteps": ["某端型留存异常且功能渗透同步降 → 「产品功能使用」", "某版本留存异常且卡顿率升 → 「完播率异常诊断」", "某渠道留存异常且 LTV/CAC<1 → 「渠道质量下降诊断」", "留存降但 cohort 结构也变 → 先写结构变化说明"], "dashboards": ["用户留存", "retention", "v_user_retention", "v_retention_decomposition"]}, {"id": "q09", "layer": "l2", "category": "渠道效率类", "title": "CAC/获客效率上升诊断", "desc": "成本侧诊断（K10）；含 CAC 变化归因（成本效应 vs 新客效应）；无成本表时不得称 CAC", "bizQuestion": "为什么获客越来越贵？", "keywords": ["CAC", "获客成本", "投放花费", "新客", "成本归因"], "triggers": ["CAC 月环比上升 >15%", "某入口订购量下滑但单成本增加", "video 入口误触率上升"], "criteria": [{"dim": "CAC vs 客单价", "ok": "≤客单价50%", "warn": "接近", "bad": ">客单价50% 标红"}, {"dim": "花费/分成", "ok": "≤1", "warn": "接近1", "bad": ">1 效率倒挂"}, {"dim": "CAC 月环比", "ok": "≤15%", "warn": "接近15%", "bad": ">15% 进调整清单"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：成本字段可用性", "desc": "花费=dwd_marketing_cost_1d；新客=dws_channel_new_user_1d；订购/分成=v_channel_analysis。成本缺失则改称「分成效率诊断」。", "judge": "成本表无数据 → 停用 CAC 标题", "output": "成本可用性确认"}, {"title": "入口 CAC 排行（K10）", "desc": "CAC=投放花费/新客数。", "sql": "WITH cost AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS total_cost\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nnewu AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS new_users\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nrev AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(platform_share_amount) AS total_share,\\n    SUM(order_users) AS total_orders, SUM(gmv_amount) AS total_gmv\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_channel_analysis\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n)\\nSELECT c.channel_code, c.total_cost, n.new_users,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost / NULLIF(n.new_users, 0), 2) AS cac,\\n  r.total_share, r.total_orders,\\n  ROUND(r.total_share / NULLIF(r.total_orders, 0), 2) AS share_per_order,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost / NULLIF(r.total_share, 0), 2) AS cost_to_share_ratio,\\n  ROUND(r.total_gmv / NULLIF(r.total_orders, 0), 2) AS avg_order_value\\nFROM cost c\\nLEFT JOIN newu n ON c.channel_code = n.channel_code\\nLEFT JOIN rev r ON c.channel_code = r.channel_code\\nORDER BY cac DESC;", "judge": "cac > avg_order_value*0.5 → 标红；cost_to_share_ratio>1 → 投放倒挂", "output": "CAC 对比表"}, {"title": "CAC 月环比", "desc": "当期 vs 上月 CAC 相对变化。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS cost, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS users FROM (\\n    SELECT channel_code, cost_amount, NULL AS new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n    UNION ALL\\n    SELECT channel_code, NULL, new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  ) t GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nprev AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS cost, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS users FROM (\\n    SELECT channel_code, cost_amount, NULL AS new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_end, INTERVAL 1 MONTH)\\n    UNION ALL\\n    SELECT channel_code, NULL, new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_end, INTERVAL 1 MONTH)\\n  ) t GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT c.channel_code,\\n  ROUND(c.cost / NULLIF(c.users, 0), 2) AS cac_cur,\\n  ROUND(p.cost / NULLIF(p.users, 0), 2) AS cac_prev,\\n  ROUND((c.cost/NULLIF(c.users,0) - p.cost/NULLIF(p.users,0)) / NULLIF(p.cost/NULLIF(p.users,0), 0) * 100, 2) AS cac_mom_pct\\nFROM cur c LEFT JOIN prev p ON c.channel_code = p.channel_code\\nORDER BY cac_mom_pct DESC;", "judge": "cac_mom_pct >15% → 进入投放调整清单", "output": "CAC 月环比表"}, {"title": "成本上升归因拆解", "desc": "CAC变化拆为成本效应 vs 新客效应。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS cost, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS users FROM (\\n    SELECT channel_code, cost_amount, NULL AS new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n    UNION ALL\\n    SELECT channel_code, NULL, new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  ) t GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nprev AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS cost, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS users FROM (\\n    SELECT channel_code, cost_amount, NULL AS new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_end, INTERVAL 1 MONTH)\\n    UNION ALL\\n    SELECT channel_code, NULL, new_user_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d WHERE stat_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_end, INTERVAL 1 MONTH)\\n  ) t GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT c.channel_code,\\n  ROUND((c.cost / NULLIF(c.users,0)) - (p.cost / NULLIF(p.users,0)), 2) AS cac_delta,\\n  ROUND((c.cost - p.cost) / NULLIF(p.users,0), 2) AS cost_effect,\\n  ROUND(p.cost * (1/NULLIF(c.users,0) - 1/NULLIF(p.users,0)), 2) AS user_effect\\nFROM cur c LEFT JOIN prev p ON c.channel_code = p.channel_code\\nORDER BY cac_delta DESC;", "judge": "cost_effect 绝对值>user_effect → 成本驱动谈价；user_effect 主导 → 新客转化降，转 q10", "output": "CAC 变化归因拆解表"}], "outputs": ["CAC 对比表", "CAC 月环比", "CAC 变化归因拆解", "高成本低效入口清单"], "nextSteps": ["cac_mom_pct>15%且客单价未同步升 → 「投放预算分配优化」", "cost_to_share_ratio>1 且持续2月 → 「渠道质量下降诊断」", "video 误触导致验证成本升 → 「付费转化下降诊断」", "user_effect 主导 → 「付费转化下降诊断」"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "v_channel_analysis"]}, {"id": "q10", "layer": "l2", "category": "流失转化类", "title": "付费转化下降诊断", "desc": "主表 dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d；含误触基线对照与失败原因归因（字段可用时）", "bizQuestion": "转化卡在哪一步？是入口误触、验证还是确认？", "keywords": ["漏斗", "转化", "误触", "收银台", "click2verify"], "triggers": ["付费转化率周环比下降", "video 入口点击高但验证低", "活动期曝光多但确认少"], "criteria": [{"dim": "click→verify vs 基线", "ok": "差≥-3pct", "warn": "接近", "bad": "低于基线>3pct → 瓶颈"}, {"dim": "误触率 vs 基线", "ok": "差≤5pct", "warn": "接近", "bad": "高于基线>5pct → 误触入口"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：漏斗表口径约定", "desc": "v_funnel 与日漏斗表口径不同，不得混用基线。主表用 expose/click/verify/purchase。", "output": "口径约定备忘"}, {"title": "漏斗转化 + 基线对照", "desc": "四环节转化；click2verify 与基线 diff。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, SUM(expose_cnt) AS expose, SUM(click_cnt) AS click,\\n    SUM(verify_cnt) AS verify, SUM(purchase_cnt) AS purchase\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\n  WHERE device_type = ''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY src_type\\n),\\nbase AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, SUM(verify_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(click_cnt),0)*100 AS baseline_click2verify_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\n  WHERE device_type = ''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :baseline_start AND :baseline_end\\n  GROUP BY src_type\\n)\\nSELECT c.src_type, c.expose, c.click, c.verify, c.purchase,\\n  ROUND(c.click/NULLIF(c.expose,0)*100,2) AS expose2click_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.verify/NULLIF(c.click,0)*100,2) AS click2verify_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.purchase/NULLIF(c.verify,0)*100,2) AS verify2purchase_pct,\\n  ROUND(b.baseline_click2verify_pct,2) AS baseline_click2verify_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.verify/NULLIF(c.click,0)*100 - b.baseline_click2verify_pct,2) AS diff_click2verify_pct\\nFROM cur c LEFT JOIN base b ON c.src_type = b.src_type\\nORDER BY diff_click2verify_pct ASC;", "judge": "diff_click2verify_pct<-3pct → 漏斗瓶颈；verify2purchase 低于基线>3pct → 确认环节问题", "output": "漏斗瓶颈诊断表"}, {"title": "误触监控 + 基线（K15）", "desc": "misclick_pct=1-verify/click，对比基线。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, SUM(click_cnt) AS click, SUM(verify_cnt) AS verify,\\n    ROUND((1-SUM(verify_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(click_cnt),0))*100,2) AS misclick_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\n  WHERE device_type=''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY src_type\\n),\\nbase AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, ROUND((1-SUM(verify_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(click_cnt),0))*100,2) AS baseline_misclick_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\n  WHERE device_type=''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :baseline_start AND :baseline_end\\n  GROUP BY src_type\\n)\\nSELECT c.src_type, c.click, c.verify, c.misclick_pct, b.baseline_misclick_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.misclick_pct - b.baseline_misclick_pct, 2) AS misclick_diff_pct\\nFROM cur c LEFT JOIN base b ON c.src_type = b.src_type\\nORDER BY misclick_diff_pct DESC;", "judge": "misclick_diff_pct >5pct → 误触入口，联动收银台改版/A/B", "output": "误触入口清单"}, {"title": "漏斗流失归因（可选）", "desc": "若含 verify_fail_reason 则拆失败原因；字段缺失则跳过并注明。", "sql": "SELECT src_type, verify_fail_reason,\\n  SUM(click_cnt) AS click, SUM(verify_cnt) AS verify,\\n  SUM(click_cnt)-SUM(verify_cnt) AS lost_cnt,\\n  ROUND((SUM(click_cnt)-SUM(verify_cnt))/NULLIF(SUM(click_cnt),0)*100,2) AS lost_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\nWHERE device_type=''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY src_type, verify_fail_reason\\nORDER BY lost_cnt DESC;", "judge": "验证超时占比>30% → 技术侧排查验证服务；字段缺失则注明待补", "output": "漏斗流失归因表（若可用）"}], "outputs": ["漏斗瓶颈诊断", "误触入口清单", "漏斗流失归因表（若字段可用）"], "nextSteps": ["diff_click2verify_pct<-3pct 且集中 video → 「A/B 测试效果评估」", "verify2purchase 低于基线>3pct → 收银台/支付排查", "misclick_diff_pct>5pct → 收银台改版 + A/B", "验证超时占比>30% → 技术侧排查"], "dashboards": ["商业化漏斗", "funnel", "v_funnel"]}, {"id": "q11", "layer": "l2", "category": "流失转化类", "title": "用户流失诊断", "desc": "确认 K14；RFM 最新快照；补流失前行为特征对比（流失 vs 留存）", "bizQuestion": "用户为什么走了？沉默与流失规模、特征如何？", "keywords": ["流失", "沉默", "churn", "RFM", "只开机", "行为特征"], "triggers": ["沉默用户占比上升", "churn_cnt 连续 7 日上升", "只开机用户占比 >35%"], "criteria": [{"dim": "churn vs 基线", "ok": "差≤20%", "warn": "接近20%", "bad": ">20% 紧急响应"}, {"dim": "只开机占比", "ok": "≤35%", "warn": "接近", "bad": ">35% → 联动功能/内容"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：沉默/流失定义（K14）", "desc": "默认沉默=连续7天无活跃、流失=连续30天；未确认前结论标「口径待确认」。", "judge": "定义未写入文档 → 不下风险结论", "output": "口径声明"}, {"title": "流失规模 vs 基线", "desc": "当月日均 churn vs 近3月基线。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') AS ym,\\n    AVG(silent_cnt) AS avg_silent, AVG(churn_cnt) AS avg_churn, AVG(approx_net_growth) AS avg_net_growth\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_lifecycle\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')\\n),\\nbase AS (\\n  SELECT AVG(churn_cnt) AS baseline_churn FROM internet_analytics.v_lifecycle\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n)\\nSELECT c.ym, c.avg_silent, c.avg_churn, c.avg_net_growth,\\n  ROUND(b.baseline_churn,2) AS baseline_churn,\\n  ROUND((c.avg_churn - b.baseline_churn)/NULLIF(b.baseline_churn,0)*100,2) AS churn_diff_pct\\nFROM cur c CROSS JOIN base b;", "judge": "churn_diff_pct >20% → 紧急响应", "output": "流失 vs 基线表"}, {"title": "流失风险分群（最新快照）", "desc": "必须带 MAX(snapshot_date)，禁止无 WHERE 全表 COUNT。", "sql": "SELECT rfm_segment, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS users,\\n  ROUND(AVG(days_since_last_active), 1) AS avg_days_since_active\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_rfm\\nWHERE snapshot_date = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm)\\nGROUP BY rfm_segment\\nORDER BY users DESC;", "judge": "映射规则未确认前只出分布，不下高/中/低风险结论", "output": "RFM 分布表"}, {"title": "流失前行为特征对比", "desc": "流失 vs 留存用户在流失前30天的功能使用差异。", "sql": "WITH churn_users AS (\\n  SELECT DISTINCT mac FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm\\n  WHERE snapshot_date=(SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm)\\n    AND rfm_segment IN (''流失风险'',''一般/流失'')\\n),\\nstay_users AS (\\n  SELECT DISTINCT mac FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm\\n  WHERE snapshot_date=(SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm)\\n    AND rfm_segment NOT IN (''流失风险'',''一般/流失'')\\n),\\nbehavior AS (\\n  SELECT a.mac,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN c.mac IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS is_churn,\\n    MAX(a.is_vod_active) AS is_vod_user,\\n    MAX(a.is_live_active) AS is_live_user,\\n    MAX(a.is_only_launcher) AS is_only_launcher_user,\\n    SUM(a.vod_play_dur)/60 AS total_vod_minutes,\\n    COUNT(DISTINCT a.snapshot_date) AS active_days\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d a\\n  LEFT JOIN churn_users c ON a.mac=c.mac\\n  WHERE a.snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 30 DAY) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n  GROUP BY a.mac\\n)\\nSELECT is_churn, COUNT(*) AS users,\\n  ROUND(AVG(is_vod_user)*100,2) AS vod_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(is_live_user)*100,2) AS live_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(is_only_launcher_user)*100,2) AS only_launcher_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(total_vod_minutes),1) AS avg_vod_minutes,\\n  ROUND(AVG(active_days),1) AS avg_active_days\\nFROM behavior GROUP BY is_churn;", "judge": "only_launcher 差>10pct→功能流失型；vod_minutes 差>50%→内容不匹配；active_days 差>30%→低粘性挽回ROI低", "output": "流失前行为特征对比表"}], "outputs": ["流失诊断报告", "流失前行为特征对比表", "高风险规模估算"], "nextSteps": ["churn_diff_pct>20% 且集中某端型/地市 → 「用户挽回策略优化」", "只开机>35% 且沉默同步升 → 「产品功能使用」+「完播率异常诊断」", "高风险>总活跃10%且映射已确认 → 「用户流失预测」", "vod_minutes 差>50% → 「内容题材分布」"], "dashboards": ["用户生命周期", "lifecycle", "v_lifecycle", "v_rfm"]}, {"id": "q12", "layer": "l2", "category": "渠道效率类", "title": "渠道质量下降诊断", "desc": "价值侧：LTV/CAC/ROI + 入口留存质量；与 q09 共用成本表；禁止 conversion_rate 冒充 ROI", "bizQuestion": "哪个入口带来的用户质量差了？", "keywords": ["渠道质量", "LTV", "CAC", "ROI", "留存"], "triggers": ["某入口新增多但留存差", "launcher 入口 LTV 低于 video", "渠道评分卡红灯"], "criteria": [{"dim": "LTV/CAC", "ok": "≥1", "warn": "接近1", "bad": "<1 标红"}, {"dim": "ROI", "ok": "≥1", "warn": "接近1", "bad": "<1 投放倒挂"}, {"dim": "双重红灯", "ok": "否", "warn": "单项红", "bad": "LTV/CAC<1 且 D7低于均值>10pct"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：LTV 窗口与成本窗口一致", "desc": "K11 观察窗口与成本归因窗口对齐；v_ltv 写全库名。", "output": "窗口对齐确认"}, {"title": "入口 LTV 对比", "desc": "补库名；按渠道汇总。", "sql": "SELECT channel_name, SUM(order_count) AS order_count, SUM(total_gmv) AS total_gmv,\\n  ROUND(AVG(avg_order_value),2) AS avg_order_value,\\n  ROUND(AVG(avg_platform_share),2) AS avg_platform_share,\\n  ROUND(SUM(total_gmv)/NULLIF(SUM(order_count),0),2) AS gmv_per_order\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY channel_name ORDER BY total_gmv DESC;", "output": "入口 LTV 排行"}, {"title": "LTV/CAC 与 ROI（K10/K11/K12）", "desc": "ROI=分成/花费，不是转化率。", "sql": "WITH ltv AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(total_gmv) AS total_gmv,\\n    SUM(avg_platform_share) AS total_share, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS user_cnt\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n),\\ncost AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS total_cost FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nnewu AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS new_users FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT l.channel_code, l.user_cnt, n.new_users,\\n  ROUND(l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0),2) AS ltv_per_user,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),2) AS cac,\\n  ROUND((l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0))/NULLIF(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),0),2) AS ltv_cac_ratio,\\n  ROUND(l.total_share/NULLIF(c.total_cost,0),2) AS roi,\\n  ROUND(l.total_gmv/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0),2) AS gmv_per_user\\nFROM ltv l LEFT JOIN cost c ON l.channel_code=c.channel_code LEFT JOIN newu n ON l.channel_code=n.channel_code\\nORDER BY ltv_cac_ratio ASC;", "judge": "ltv_cac_ratio<1 → 标红；roi<1 → 投放倒挂", "output": "渠道质量对比表（LTV/CAC/ROI）"}, {"title": "入口留存质量对比", "desc": "财务侧之外补 D7/D30 留存，区分「该收缩」与「该谈价」。", "sql": "SELECT r.channel_code,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN r.day_offset=7 THEN r.retention_rate END),2) AS d7_retention,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN r.day_offset=30 THEN r.retention_rate END),2) AS d30_retention,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT r.cohort_date) AS cohort_cnt\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_user_retention r\\nWHERE r.cohort_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY r.channel_code\\nORDER BY d7_retention ASC;", "judge": "D7低于全渠道均值>10pct 且 LTV/CAC<1 → 双重红灯优先收缩；D7正常但 LTV/CAC<1 → 谈价而非收缩", "output": "入口留存质量表 + 双重红灯清单"}], "outputs": ["渠道质量诊断（LTV/CAC/ROI + D7/D30）", "低效入口收缩建议", "双重红灯渠道清单"], "nextSteps": ["ltv_cac_ratio<1 且 D7低于均值>10pct → 「渠道组合优化」", "ltv_cac_ratio<1 但留存正常 → 「定价策略优化」", "roi<1 且持续2月 → 「投放预算分配优化」", "归因口径存疑 → 工具箱「渠道归因分析」"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "v_ltv", "v_channel_analysis"]}, {"id": "q13", "layer": "l2", "category": "内容质量类", "title": "完播率异常诊断", "desc": "整体完播 vs 基线；VV Top50 低完播清单；题材对比；QoS 指标联动（表可用时）", "bizQuestion": "为什么完播率下降了？内容问题还是 QoS？", "keywords": ["完播率", "QoS", "卡顿", "加权完播", "题材"], "triggers": ["整体完播率月环比下降 >5pct", "某题材完播率骤降", "首帧/卡顿投诉上升"], "criteria": [{"dim": "整体完播 vs 基线", "ok": "差≥-5pct", "warn": "接近", "bad": "<-5pct → 进诊"}, {"dim": "剧集完播(Top50 VV)", "ok": "≥30%", "warn": "接近30%", "bad": "<30% 列入排查"}, {"dim": "卡顿率环比", "ok": "≤+2pct", "warn": "接近", "bad": ">+2pct 且完播降 → QoS"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置：完播口径声明（K13）", "desc": "加权完播=finish_cnt/vv；剧集平均完播另列；两者不得混读。", "output": "完播口径脚注"}, {"title": "整体完播率 vs 基线", "desc": "当期加权完播 vs 近3月月均值。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT ROUND(SUM(finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(vv),0)*100,2) AS finish_rate_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n),\\nbase AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') AS ym,\\n    ROUND(SUM(finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(vv),0)*100,2) AS finish_rate_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n  GROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')\\n)\\nSELECT c.finish_rate_pct AS cur_finish_rate,\\n  ROUND(AVG(b.finish_rate_pct),2) AS baseline_finish_rate,\\n  ROUND(c.finish_rate_pct - AVG(b.finish_rate_pct),2) AS diff_pct\\nFROM cur c CROSS JOIN base b\\nGROUP BY c.finish_rate_pct;", "judge": "diff_pct < -5pct → 整体完播异常，进入低完播清单", "output": "整体完播 vs 基线"}, {"title": "低完播剧集（VV Top50）", "desc": "HAVING 用 SUM(vv)；加权与平均完播分列。", "sql": "WITH top50 AS (\\n  SELECT series_id FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY series_id ORDER BY SUM(vv) DESC LIMIT 50\\n)\\nSELECT s.series_id, se.series_name, SUM(s.vv) AS vv,\\n  ROUND(SUM(s.finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(s.vv),0)*100,2) AS weighted_finish_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(s.complete_rate_avg),2) AS avg_series_complete_rate,\\n  ROUND(SUM(s.finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(s.vv),0)*100 - AVG(s.complete_rate_avg),2) AS weighted_vs_avg_gap\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_content_series se ON s.series_id=se.series_id\\nJOIN top50 t ON s.series_id=t.series_id\\nWHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY s.series_id, se.series_name\\nHAVING SUM(s.vv) >= 100\\nORDER BY weighted_finish_rate_pct ASC\\nLIMIT 20;", "judge": "加权完播<30% 且在 Top50 → 列入排查；weighted_vs_avg_gap 绝对值>15pct → 看单集分布", "output": "低完播剧集清单（加权+平均分列）"}, {"title": "题材完播对比", "desc": "区分内容问题 vs QoS 嫌疑。", "sql": "SELECT g.genre_name, SUM(s.vv) AS vv, SUM(s.finish_cnt) AS finish,\\n  ROUND(SUM(s.finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(s.vv),0)*100,2) AS weighted_finish_rate_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_genre g ON s.genre_id=g.genre_id\\nWHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY g.genre_name\\nORDER BY weighted_finish_rate_pct ASC;", "judge": "题材完播低且卡顿环比升>2pct → QoS；完播低但卡顿平稳 → 内容问题", "output": "题材完播对比表"}, {"title": "QoS 指标联动（可选）", "desc": "若存在 dws_qos_play_quality_1d 则查首帧/卡顿/失败率；表不存在则注明无法区分内容/QoS。", "sql": "SELECT DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') AS ym,\\n  ROUND(AVG(first_frame_ms),0) AS avg_first_frame_ms,\\n  ROUND(AVG(stutter_rate_pct),2) AS avg_stutter_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(play_fail_rate_pct),2) AS avg_play_fail_rate_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_qos_play_quality_1d\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')\\nORDER BY ym;", "judge": "卡顿率环比升>2pct 且完播同步降 → QoS；QoS 平稳但完播降 → 内容运营", "output": "QoS 指标趋势（若可用）"}], "outputs": ["整体完播趋势 vs 基线", "低完播剧集清单", "题材完播对比", "QoS 指标趋势（若可用）"], "nextSteps": ["卡顿率环比升>2pct 且完播降 → 「完播与QoS」看板", "QoS 平稳但完播降 → 内容运营/排期调整", "完播低且 only_launcher 升 → 回 L1「产品功能使用」", "某题材完播低但其他正常 → 题材级内容排查"], "dashboards": ["完播与QoS", "quality", "内容·剧集", "series"]}, {"id": "q14", "layer": "l3", "category": "DAU预测类", "title": "下月 DAU 预测", "desc": "区分 MA7（平稳）与线性趋势；区间用残差标准差而非全期 STDDEV；必做 MAPE 回测", "bizQuestion": "下个月日活大概多少？区间是多少？", "keywords": ["DAU", "预测", "MA7", "线性趋势", "MAPE", "残差"], "triggers": ["月度经营计划编制", "暑期档资源排期", "DAU 异常波动后需预测回补"], "criteria": [{"dim": "回测 MAPE", "ok": "≤15% 可用于计划", "warn": "15%–25% 仅趋势参考", "bad": ">15% 不得写入经营计划"}, {"dim": "残差/均值", "ok": "≤10%", "warn": ">10% 不确定性高", "bad": "区间过宽需提示"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置四件事", "desc": "数据质量；DAU 口径(K01)与是否分端预测；近90日异常点；平稳则 MA7，有趋势则线性外推。", "judge": "有明显趋势时不得只用 MA7", "output": "方法选择说明 + 异常点清单"}, {"title": "近90日基线与残差波动", "desc": "修正：区间用 MA7 残差标准差 residual_std_ma7，不用全期 STDDEV。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\n),\\nma AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau,\\n    AVG(total_dau) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS ma7\\n  FROM daily\\n)\\nSELECT ROUND(AVG(total_dau),0) AS avg_dau_90d, ROUND(STDDEV(total_dau),0) AS std_dau_90d,\\n  MIN(total_dau) AS min_dau, MAX(total_dau) AS max_dau,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(total_dau - ma7),0) AS residual_std_ma7, ROUND(AVG(ma7),0) AS avg_ma7\\nFROM ma;", "judge": "residual_std_ma7/avg_ma7>10% → 提示不确定性高；有线性趋势 → 转步骤2b", "output": "基线统计 + residual_std_ma7"}, {"title": "MA7 外推（平稳场景）", "desc": "点估计=基准日 ma7；区间=ma7±1.5×residual_std_ma7（经营计划可用 k=2）。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 29 DAY) AND :as_of\\n),\\nma AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau,\\n    AVG(total_dau) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS ma7\\n  FROM daily\\n)\\nSELECT snapshot_date, total_dau, ROUND(ma7,0) AS ma7_dau FROM ma ORDER BY snapshot_date;", "output": "MA7 序列 + 点估计/区间说明"}, {"title": "线性趋势外推（有趋势场景）", "desc": "近90日最小二乘；点估计=intercept+slope×t；区间用 residual_std_linear。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau,\\n    DATEDIFF(snapshot_date, DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY)) AS t\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\n)\\nSELECT\\n  ROUND((AVG(t*total_dau)-AVG(t)*AVG(total_dau))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0),2) AS slope,\\n  ROUND(AVG(total_dau)-((AVG(t*total_dau)-AVG(t)*AVG(total_dau))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0))*AVG(t),2) AS intercept,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(total_dau-(AVG(total_dau)+((AVG(t*total_dau)-AVG(t)*AVG(total_dau))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0))*(t-AVG(t)))),0) AS residual_std_linear\\nFROM daily;", "output": "slope/intercept/residual_std_linear"}, {"title": "回测校验 MAPE（必做）", "desc": "walk-forward：近窗拟合预测，报告 MAPE。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau FROM internet_analytics.v_dau_overview\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\n),\\nma AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, total_dau,\\n    AVG(total_dau) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS ma7\\n  FROM daily\\n)\\nSELECT ROUND(AVG(ABS(total_dau-ma7)/NULLIF(total_dau,0))*100,2) AS mape_pct\\nFROM ma WHERE snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 30 DAY);", "judge": "MAPE>15% → 仅趋势参考，不得写入经营计划；≤15% 可用于计划", "output": "MAPE + 是否可用于经营计划"}], "outputs": ["下月 DAU 点估计+区间（含k与残差来源）", "端型拆分预测", "回测 MAPE 与可用性结论", "假设与失效条件"], "nextSteps": ["预测区间下限低于经营目标>10%且MAPE≤15% → 「投放预算分配优化」", "上限高于目标且残差大 → 验证内容排期+情景分析", "MAPE>15% → 不进入预算决策，先补数据/换方法"], "dashboards": ["活跃总览", "overview", "v_dau_overview"]}, {"id": "q15", "layer": "l3", "category": "LTV预测类", "title": "LTV/ARPU 预测（订购客单）", "desc": "补库名与时间过滤；按 cohort 衰减外推；MAPE>20% 不得用于加码绝对判断", "bizQuestion": "这批用户长期值多少钱？", "keywords": ["LTV", "ARPU", "cohort", "衰减", "MAPE"], "triggers": ["评估新入口是否值得加码", "会员/连续包月策略调整前", "渠道试投结束"], "criteria": [{"dim": "LTV 回测 MAPE", "ok": "≤20%", "warn": "接近20%", "bad": ">20% 仅排序参考"}, {"dim": "LTV下限/CAC", "ok": ">1 且 MAPE≤20%", "warn": "接近1", "bad": "≤1 不加码"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置四件事", "desc": "确认 K11 观察窗口；cohort 定义；v_ltv 口径。窗口未定不得称终身价值。", "output": "窗口与 cohort 定义声明"}, {"title": "入口 LTV 现状", "desc": "补 internet_analytics.v_ltv 与时间过滤。", "sql": "SELECT channel_name, SUM(order_count) AS order_count, SUM(total_gmv) AS total_gmv,\\n  ROUND(AVG(avg_order_value),2) AS avg_order_value,\\n  ROUND(AVG(avg_platform_share),2) AS avg_platform_share,\\n  ROUND(SUM(total_gmv)/NULLIF(SUM(order_count),0),2) AS gmv_per_order\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY channel_name ORDER BY total_gmv DESC;", "output": "入口 LTV 现状表"}, {"title": "cohort 客单趋势", "desc": "按 cohort_month×入口看 ARPU 衰减，支撑「这批用户」外推。", "sql": "SELECT cohort_month, channel_name, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS cohort_users,\\n  ROUND(SUM(order_amount)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT mac),0),2) AS arpu_cohort,\\n  ROUND(SUM(revenue_share)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT mac),0),2) AS arpu_share_cohort\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\nWHERE src_type<>''ALL''\\n  AND cohort_month BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 6 MONTH) AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY cohort_month, channel_name\\nORDER BY cohort_month, channel_name;", "judge": "老 cohort ARPU 逐月衰减明显 → 须用衰减曲线而非固定 ARPU", "output": "cohort ARPU 趋势表"}, {"title": "LTV 外推（衰减曲线）", "desc": "按 month_offset 准备累计 ARPU；应用层拟合 a×offset^(-b) 外推至窗口终点。", "sql": "SELECT cohort_month, channel_name, month_offset,\\n  SUM(revenue_share)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT mac),0) AS arpu_at_offset\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\nWHERE src_type<>''ALL''\\n  AND cohort_month BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 6 MONTH) AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY cohort_month, channel_name, month_offset\\nORDER BY cohort_month, channel_name, month_offset;", "output": "衰减曲线拟合输入 + LTV 点估计/区间（应用层）"}, {"title": "回测校验", "desc": "前3个月 cohort 拟合，预测后3个月 ARPU，算 MAPE。", "judge": "MAPE>20% → 仅排序参考，不得用于是否加码的绝对判断", "output": "MAPE + 可用性结论"}], "outputs": ["入口 LTV 预测区间（含 cohort/窗口假设）", "ARPU 基准/乐观/悲观情景", "回测 MAPE 与可用性结论"], "nextSteps": ["LTV区间下限/CAC>1且MAPE≤20% → 「渠道质量下降诊断」", "LTV对定价敏感 → 「定价策略优化」", "MAPE>20% → 仅渠道排序，不用于加码决策"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "v_ltv"]}, {"id": "q16", "layer": "l3", "category": "渠道预测类", "title": "渠道效果预测", "desc": "统一用日漏斗表口径；先做曝光CV稳定性检验；订购外推含月份天数与星期效应；必做 MAPE", "bizQuestion": "各入口下月能带来多少订购？", "keywords": ["渠道", "订购预测", "CV", "星期效应", "MAPE"], "triggers": ["季度渠道预算评审", "新入口试投评估", "入口改版效果预判"], "criteria": [{"dim": "曝光 CV", "ok": "≤30%", "warn": ">30% 假设不稳", "bad": "不得单点外推"}, {"dim": "回测 MAPE", "ok": "≤15%", "warn": "15%–25%", "bad": ">15% 不进预算评审"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置四件事", "desc": "统一用 dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d；试投不足30天不预测；单列已知活动/改版。", "judge": "试投期<30天 → 延长试投，不做预测", "output": "口径约定 + 外生变量清单"}, {"title": "入口历史转化基线", "desc": "近3完整月 expose→purchase；禁止用 v_funnel.product_line 冒充 src_type。", "sql": "SELECT src_type, SUM(expose_cnt) AS expose, SUM(click_cnt) AS click,\\n  SUM(verify_cnt) AS verify, SUM(purchase_cnt) AS purchase,\\n  ROUND(SUM(purchase_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(expose_cnt),0)*100,4) AS cvr_expose2purchase_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(purchase_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(click_cnt),0)*100,2) AS cvr_click2purchase_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\nWHERE device_type=''ALL''\\n  AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\nGROUP BY src_type;", "judge": "CVR 月波动>20% → 须用区间；某入口显著偏低 → 单独标注", "output": "入口转化基线表"}, {"title": "曝光/转化稳定性（CV）", "desc": "替代原「假设曝光维持均值」未验证。", "sql": "SELECT src_type,\\n  ROUND(AVG(expose_cnt),0) AS avg_daily_expose, ROUND(STDDEV(expose_cnt),0) AS std_daily_expose,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(expose_cnt)/NULLIF(AVG(expose_cnt),0)*100,2) AS cv_expose_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(confirm_cnt),0) AS avg_daily_confirm, ROUND(STDDEV(confirm_cnt),0) AS std_daily_confirm,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(confirm_cnt)/NULLIF(AVG(confirm_cnt),0)*100,2) AS cv_confirm_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\nWHERE device_type=''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 29 DAY) AND :as_of\\nGROUP BY src_type;", "judge": "CV>30% → 维持均值假设不成立，改用星期因子或区间预测", "output": "稳定性检验表"}, {"title": "下月订购外推（天数+星期）", "desc": "修正日均×30；用 dim_date 星期分布 × 历史 dow 均值。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, src_type, SUM(confirm_cnt) AS confirm\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\n  WHERE device_type=''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 59 DAY) AND :as_of\\n  GROUP BY snapshot_date, src_type\\n),\\ndow AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, DAYOFWEEK(snapshot_date) AS dow, AVG(confirm) AS avg_confirm_dow\\n  FROM daily GROUP BY src_type, DAYOFWEEK(snapshot_date)\\n),\\nnext_month AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, d.day_of_week AS dow, COUNT(*) AS days_cnt\\n  FROM (SELECT DISTINCT src_type FROM daily) s\\n  CROSS JOIN (\\n    SELECT date_key, day_of_week FROM internet_analytics.dim_date\\n    WHERE date_key BETWEEN :next_month_start AND :next_month_end\\n  ) d\\n  GROUP BY src_type, d.day_of_week\\n)\\nSELECT n.src_type, ROUND(SUM(n.days_cnt*d.avg_confirm_dow),0) AS forecast_monthly_confirm,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(d.avg_confirm_dow),0) AS dow_std\\nFROM next_month n JOIN dow d ON n.src_type=d.src_type AND n.dow=d.dow\\nGROUP BY n.src_type;", "output": "下月订购点估计（区间用残差×sqrt天数）"}, {"title": "回测 MAPE", "desc": "前60天预测后30天。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, src_type, SUM(confirm_cnt) AS confirm\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_cashier_funnel_1d\\n  WHERE device_type=''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\n  GROUP BY snapshot_date, src_type\\n),\\nma30 AS (\\n  SELECT src_type, snapshot_date, confirm,\\n    AVG(confirm) OVER (PARTITION BY src_type ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 29 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS ma30\\n  FROM daily\\n)\\nSELECT src_type, ROUND(AVG(ABS(confirm-ma30)/NULLIF(confirm,0))*100,2) AS mape_pct\\nFROM ma30 WHERE snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 30 DAY)\\nGROUP BY src_type;", "judge": "MAPE>15% → 该入口仅趋势参考，不进预算评审", "output": "分入口 MAPE"}], "outputs": ["下月各入口订购点估计+区间", "曝光稳定性与假设失效条件", "回测 MAPE", "入口优先级（贡献×置信度）"], "nextSteps": ["预测贡献占比<5%且CV>30% → 「渠道组合优化」", "贡献环比升>20%且MAPE≤15% → 「投放预算分配优化」", "试投<30天 → 不做预测延长试投", "MAPE>15% → 不进预算评审"], "dashboards": ["商业化漏斗", "funnel", "v_funnel", "v_channel_attribution"]}, {"id": "q17", "layer": "l3", "category": "流失预测类", "title": "用户流失预测", "desc": "MA7仅趋势参考；RFM须最新快照；线性/MA7外推+区间；高风险阈值需业务校准", "bizQuestion": "下个月大概流失多少人？哪些人最可能流失？", "keywords": ["流失", "预测", "RFM", "MAPE", "高风险"], "triggers": ["沉默用户占比持续上升", "续订率下滑预警", "挽回预算编制"], "criteria": [{"dim": "回测 MAPE", "ok": "≤15%", "warn": "15%–25%", "bad": ">15% 不进挽回预算"}, {"dim": "高风险占比", "ok": "已业务校准", "warn": "沿用15%经验值须标注", "bad": "未校准不进预算"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置四件事", "desc": "确认 K14；v_rfm 快照过滤；churn_cnt 定义；高风险阈值待校准。", "output": "定义与阈值声明"}, {"title": "流失趋势 MA7（≠预测）", "desc": "平滑历史趋势，预测在步骤3。", "sql": "SELECT snapshot_date, silent_cnt, churn_cnt,\\n  ROUND(AVG(churn_cnt) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW),0) AS ma7_churn\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_lifecycle\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 29 DAY) AND :as_of\\nORDER BY snapshot_date;", "output": "流失趋势+MA7参考线"}, {"title": "高风险规模（最新快照）", "desc": "修正无 WHERE 虚高；占比=高风险/总活跃，标注阈值待校准。", "sql": "SELECT rfm_segment, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS users,\\n  ROUND(AVG(days_since_last_active),1) AS avg_days_since_active\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_rfm\\nWHERE snapshot_date=(SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm)\\n  AND rfm_segment IN (''流失风险'',''一般/流失'')\\nGROUP BY rfm_segment;\\n\\nSELECT COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS total_active\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end;", "judge": "占比>15%且连续2月上升 → 启动挽回预算编制（阈值须业务校准）", "output": "高风险规模与占比"}, {"title": "下月流失外推+区间", "desc": "有趋势用线性，否则 MA7；点估计×下月天数；区间含 sqrt(天数)。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, churn_cnt,\\n    DATEDIFF(snapshot_date, DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY)) AS t\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_lifecycle\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\n)\\nSELECT\\n  ROUND((AVG(t*churn_cnt)-AVG(t)*AVG(churn_cnt))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0),4) AS slope,\\n  ROUND(AVG(churn_cnt)-((AVG(t*churn_cnt)-AVG(t)*AVG(churn_cnt))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0))*AVG(t),2) AS intercept,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(churn_cnt-(AVG(churn_cnt)+((AVG(t*churn_cnt)-AVG(t)*AVG(churn_cnt))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0))*(t-AVG(t)))),0) AS residual_std_linear\\nFROM daily;\\n\\n-- MA7 备选\\nWITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, churn_cnt FROM internet_analytics.v_lifecycle\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 29 DAY) AND :as_of\\n),\\nma AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, churn_cnt,\\n    AVG(churn_cnt) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS ma7\\n  FROM daily\\n)\\nSELECT ROUND(AVG(ma7),0) AS ma7_avg, ROUND(STDDEV(churn_cnt-ma7),0) AS residual_std_ma7 FROM ma;", "judge": "|slope|/均值>1%/天 → 用线性；否则用 MA7", "output": "下月流失点估计+区间"}, {"title": "回测 MAPE + 阈值校准", "desc": "MAPE>15%仅趋势参考；高风险占比阈值标注待业务校准。", "judge": "MAPE>15% → 不进挽回预算", "output": "MAPE + 阈值校准说明"}], "outputs": ["下月流失点估计+区间", "高风险规模与占比（含阈值说明）", "挽回优先级人群规模", "假设与失效条件"], "nextSteps": ["预测流失下限>挽回预算可覆盖规模 → 「用户挽回策略优化」", "流失升且 L2 已定位根因 → 回对应 L2 复核", "高风险阈值未校准 → 先校准再进预算", "MAPE>15% → 仅趋势参考"], "dashboards": ["用户生命周期", "lifecycle", "v_lifecycle", "v_rfm"]}, {"id": "q18", "layer": "l3", "category": "收入预测类", "title": "分成收入预测", "desc": "确认 revenue_share 口径；分成率稳定性；天数+星期外推；三情景；MAPE 回测", "bizQuestion": "下月分成收入大概多少？区间是多少？", "keywords": ["分成", "收入预测", "情景", "星期效应", "MAPE"], "triggers": ["月度财务结算前", "内容采购成本评估", "套餐定价调整前"], "criteria": [{"dim": "分成率波动", "ok": "≤2pct", "warn": ">2pct 须拆套餐", "bad": "不稳定不可整体外推"}, {"dim": "回测 MAPE", "ok": "≤15%", "warn": "15%–25%", "bad": ">15% 不进财务预算"}], "steps": [{"title": "前置四件事", "desc": "确认 revenue_share 方向；下月天数/活动/调价；结算延迟；套餐结构稳定性。", "output": "口径与外生变量声明"}, {"title": "近3月分成趋势", "desc": "含 share_rate_pct。", "sql": "SELECT DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') AS month,\\n  SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, ROUND(SUM(order_amount),0) AS order_amount,\\n  ROUND(SUM(revenue_share),0) AS revenue_share,\\n  ROUND(SUM(revenue_share)/NULLIF(SUM(order_amount),0)*100,2) AS share_rate_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\nWHERE src_type<>''ALL''\\n  AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\nGROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')\\nORDER BY month;", "judge": "share_rate 月波动>2pct → 须分套餐/品类拆解", "output": "分成趋势表"}, {"title": "分成率稳定性检验", "desc": "按入口看 share_rate 波动。", "sql": "SELECT src_type,\\n  ROUND(SUM(revenue_share)/NULLIF(SUM(order_amount),0)*100,2) AS share_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(revenue_share/NULLIF(order_amount,0))*100,2) AS share_rate_std_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\nWHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\nGROUP BY src_type;", "judge": "share_rate_std_pct>2pct → 分套餐拆解后再预测", "output": "分成率稳定性表"}, {"title": "下月分成外推（天数+星期）", "desc": "修正日均×30；用 dim_date × dow 均值。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(revenue_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 59 DAY) AND :as_of\\n  GROUP BY snapshot_date\\n),\\ndow AS (\\n  SELECT DAYOFWEEK(snapshot_date) AS dow, AVG(share) AS avg_share_dow FROM daily GROUP BY DAYOFWEEK(snapshot_date)\\n),\\nnext_month AS (\\n  SELECT d.day_of_week AS dow, COUNT(*) AS days_cnt FROM internet_analytics.dim_date d\\n  WHERE d.date_key BETWEEN :next_month_start AND :next_month_end\\n  GROUP BY d.day_of_week\\n)\\nSELECT ROUND(SUM(n.days_cnt*d.avg_share_dow),0) AS forecast_monthly_share,\\n  ROUND(STDDEV(d.avg_share_dow),0) AS dow_std\\nFROM next_month n JOIN dow d ON n.dow=d.dow;", "output": "分成点估计（区间用残差×sqrt天数）"}, {"title": "情景分析（基准/乐观/悲观）", "desc": "乐观须用历史活动 lift，无数据则不得臆造；悲观用历史最差环比。", "sql": "SELECT\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN is_activity=1 THEN revenue_share END),0) AS avg_activity_share,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN is_activity=0 THEN revenue_share END),0) AS avg_normal_share,\\n  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN is_activity=1 THEN revenue_share END)/NULLIF(AVG(CASE WHEN is_activity=0 THEN revenue_share END),0),2) AS activity_lift_ratio\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\nWHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 180 DAY) AND :as_of;", "judge": "无历史活动数据 → 乐观情景按基准+0%（不臆造）", "output": "三情景对比表（含假设）"}, {"title": "回测 MAPE", "desc": "前60天预测后30天。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(revenue_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 89 DAY) AND :as_of\\n  GROUP BY snapshot_date\\n),\\nma30 AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, share,\\n    AVG(share) OVER (ORDER BY snapshot_date ROWS BETWEEN 29 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS ma30\\n  FROM daily\\n)\\nSELECT ROUND(AVG(ABS(share-ma30)/NULLIF(share,0))*100,2) AS mape_pct\\nFROM ma30 WHERE snapshot_date >= DATE_SUB(:as_of, INTERVAL 30 DAY);", "judge": "MAPE>15% → 不进入财务预算", "output": "MAPE + 可用性结论"}], "outputs": ["下月分成点估计+区间", "三情景对比表", "回测 MAPE", "套餐/品类贡献拆解"], "nextSteps": ["预测下限低于财务目标>10%且MAPE≤15% → 「定价策略优化」", "分成率月波动>2pct → 先拆套餐再预测", "MAPE>15% → 不进财务预算", "某套餐贡献环比降>20% → 内容采购成本评估"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "dws_trade_order_1d"]}, {"id": "q19", "layer": "l4", "category": "获客效率类", "title": "渠道获客效率评估", "desc": "同窗口计算 LTV/CAC 并分级；补窗口敏感性与样本充足性，避免无 CAC 却套用 LTV/CAC 阈值", "bizQuestion": "各入口投放划不划算？该加码、维持还是收缩？", "keywords": ["CAC", "LTV", "ROI", "评估", "获客效率", "窗口敏感性"], "triggers": ["季度预算评审", "新入口试投结束", "渠道评分卡定期复盘"], "criteria": [{"dim": "LTV/CAC", "ok": ">3 加码", "warn": "1–3 维持", "bad": "<1 收缩"}, {"dim": "窗口敏感性", "ok": "±30%内评级稳健", "warn": "偏离>30%仅参考", "bad": "样本不足不进决策"}], "steps": [{"title": "评估前置四件事", "desc": "LTV与CAC同观察窗口；反事实用同渠道历史或同类均值并注明参照系；CAC=花费/新客(K10)，LTV=窗口分成/用户(K11)；试投<30天或新客不足标样本不足。", "judge": "窗口不一致则结论无效", "output": "基线/反事实/口径/样本声明"}, {"title": "LTV/CAC 比率（修正无 CAC）", "desc": "合并 v_ltv、dwd_marketing_cost_1d、dws_channel_new_user_1d；同窗口计算并分级。", "sql": "WITH ltv AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(avg_platform_share) AS total_share, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS user_cnt\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n),\\ncost AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS total_cost FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nnewu AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS new_users FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT l.channel_code, l.user_cnt, n.new_users,\\n  ROUND(l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0),2) AS ltv_per_user,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),2) AS cac,\\n  ROUND((l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0))/NULLIF(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),0),2) AS ltv_cac_ratio,\\n  CASE\\n    WHEN (l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0))/NULLIF(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),0) < 1 THEN ''收缩''\\n    WHEN (l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0))/NULLIF(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),0) > 3 THEN ''加码''\\n    ELSE ''维持'' END AS rating\\nFROM ltv l\\nLEFT JOIN cost c ON l.channel_code=c.channel_code\\nLEFT JOIN newu n ON l.channel_code=n.channel_code\\nORDER BY ltv_cac_ratio ASC;", "judge": "<1 收缩；1–3 维持；>3 加码", "output": "渠道效率评估表"}, {"title": "窗口敏感性", "desc": "近1月 vs 近3月 LTV，偏离>30%标窗口敏感。", "sql": "WITH ltv_1m AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(avg_platform_share)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT mac),0) AS ltv_1m\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 MONTH) AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n),\\nltv_3m AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(avg_platform_share)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT mac),0) AS ltv_3m\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n)\\nSELECT a.channel_code, ROUND(a.ltv_1m,2) AS ltv_1m, ROUND(b.ltv_3m,2) AS ltv_3m,\\n  ROUND(a.ltv_1m/NULLIF(b.ltv_3m,0),2) AS window_sensitivity\\nFROM ltv_1m a JOIN ltv_3m b ON a.channel_code=b.channel_code\\nORDER BY window_sensitivity ASC;", "judge": "|window_sensitivity-1|>0.3 → 窗口敏感，结论仅供参考", "output": "窗口敏感性表"}, {"title": "样本充足性（K19）", "desc": "新客量门槛：<100不足；<500效力有限。", "sql": "SELECT channel_code, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS new_users,\\n  CASE WHEN SUM(new_user_cnt)<100 THEN ''样本不足''\\n       WHEN SUM(new_user_cnt)<500 THEN ''样本偏少，结论效力有限''\\n       ELSE ''样本充足'' END AS sample_flag\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d\\nWHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY channel_code;", "judge": "样本不足渠道不进入预算决策", "output": "样本充足性标注"}], "outputs": ["渠道效率评估表（LTV/CAC/评级/敏感性/样本）", "投放评级清单（加码/维持/收缩）", "评估结论三要素"], "nextSteps": ["评级=加码且敏感性±30%内且样本充足 → 「投放预算分配优化」", "评级=收缩且连续2季度 → 「渠道组合优化」", "敏感性超±30% → 延长窗口后重评，不进入决策", "样本不足 → 延长试投，不进入预算决策"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "v_ltv", "v_channel_analysis"]}, {"id": "q20", "layer": "l4", "category": "实验评估类", "title": "A/B 测试效果评估", "desc": "最小样本量 + 分流有效性 + 两比例 z 检验 + 95% CI；禁止用「差异>2pct且样本>1000」拍脑袋显著", "bizQuestion": "改版实验有没有效？能不能全量？", "keywords": ["A/B", "实验", "显著性", "z检验", "置信区间", "MDE"], "triggers": ["收银台 UI 改版上线", "launcher 引导策略 A/B 测试结束", "video 误触优化实验"], "criteria": [{"dim": "显著性", "ok": "|z|>1.96 且 CI下界>0", "warn": "接近边界", "bad": "不显著或样本不足"}, {"dim": "分流", "ok": "与设计比偏离≤5pct", "warn": "接近5pct", "bad": ">5pct 先查分流"}], "steps": [{"title": "评估前置四件事", "desc": "control=基线、treatment=评估组；确认无串组污染；指标/窗口/过滤一致；先算最小样本量再看是否达标。", "output": "实验设计与功效声明"}, {"title": "最小样本量与分流有效性", "desc": "两比例检验 n 公式（α=0.05,power=0.8）；检查流量占比与设计分流比。", "sql": "SELECT compare_name, variant,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS users,\\n  ROUND(COUNT(DISTINCT mac)/SUM(COUNT(DISTINCT mac)) OVER (PARTITION BY compare_name)*100,2) AS traffic_share_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_ab_experiment\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY compare_name, variant;", "judge": "与设计分流比偏离>5pct → 先查分流逻辑；样本未达最小量 → 不得下结论", "output": "分流有效性 + 最小样本量核对"}, {"title": "实验组 vs 对照组 + z 检验", "desc": "汇总 confirm/sample，输出绝对差与 z_score。", "sql": "WITH agg AS (\\n  SELECT compare_name, variant, SUM(sample_size) AS n, SUM(confirm_cnt) AS confirm\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ab_experiment\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY compare_name, variant\\n),\\npivot AS (\\n  SELECT compare_name,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN variant=''control'' THEN n END) AS n_ctrl,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN variant=''control'' THEN confirm END) AS x_ctrl,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN variant=''treatment'' THEN n END) AS n_trt,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN variant=''treatment'' THEN confirm END) AS x_trt\\n  FROM agg GROUP BY compare_name\\n)\\nSELECT compare_name, n_ctrl, x_ctrl, ROUND(x_ctrl/NULLIF(n_ctrl,0)*100,2) AS cvr_ctrl_pct,\\n  n_trt, x_trt, ROUND(x_trt/NULLIF(n_trt,0)*100,2) AS cvr_trt_pct,\\n  ROUND((x_trt/NULLIF(n_trt,0)-x_ctrl/NULLIF(n_ctrl,0))*100,2) AS abs_diff_pct,\\n  ROUND((x_trt/NULLIF(n_trt,0)-x_ctrl/NULLIF(n_ctrl,0))/SQRT(\\n    (x_trt+x_ctrl)/NULLIF(n_trt+n_ctrl,0)*(1-(x_trt+x_ctrl)/NULLIF(n_trt+n_ctrl,0))*(1/NULLIF(n_trt,0)+1/NULLIF(n_ctrl,0))\\n  ),2) AS z_score\\nFROM pivot;", "judge": "|z|>1.96 → 显著；≤1.96 → 不显著，不得下有效结论；须同时报效应量与样本量", "output": "A/B 对比表（含z）"}, {"title": "95% 置信区间", "desc": "两比例差 CI≈diff±1.96×SE；决策看 CI 下界是否仍有业务意义。", "judge": "CI下界≤0 → 不能排除无效果；下界>0且业务增量达标 → 可全量", "output": "95% CI + 全量/回滚建议"}], "outputs": ["A/B 对比表（样本量/CVR/绝对差/z/CI）", "分流有效性结论", "全量/回滚/延长建议"], "nextSteps": ["p<0.05且CI下界>0且业务增量达标 → 全量发布", "p≥0.05或CI含0 → 「增长实验设计」重规划", "分流不通过 → 修复分流后重跑", "样本未达最小量 → 延长实验，不得下结论"], "dashboards": ["商业化漏斗", "funnel", "v_ab_experiment"]}, {"id": "q21", "layer": "l4", "category": "产品效果类", "title": "产品功能效果评估（内容）", "desc": "参数化前后窗口；大盘对照算超额 VV；点播渗透按去重 MAC（禁止行数分母）", "bizQuestion": "这次内容/功能改版效果好吗？该不该加推？", "keywords": ["内容", "VV", "完播", "渗透", "超额变化", "DID"], "triggers": ["新剧集上线后 7 日", "推荐算法调整后", "暑期档内容包发布"], "criteria": [{"dim": "超额 VV", "ok": ">10%且完播未降", "warn": ">0但完播降", "bad": "≤0 不加推"}, {"dim": "渗透与超额", "ok": "同向", "warn": "接近", "bad": "反方向挤占"}], "steps": [{"title": "评估前置四件事", "desc": "改版前同长度窗口作基线，优先 DID；须排除大盘季节性；完播口径(K13)前后一致；单剧集VV过低需合并题材。", "output": "窗口/反事实/口径/样本声明"}, {"title": "目标剧集前后对比 + 大盘超额", "desc": "分别算 pre/post 完播；excess=剧集增速-大盘增速。", "sql": "WITH series_period AS (\\n  SELECT s.series_id,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :pre_start AND :pre_end THEN s.vv ELSE 0 END) AS vv_pre,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :post_start AND :post_end THEN s.vv ELSE 0 END) AS vv_post,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :pre_start AND :pre_end THEN s.finish_cnt ELSE 0 END) AS fin_pre,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :post_start AND :post_end THEN s.finish_cnt ELSE 0 END) AS fin_post\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\n  WHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :pre_start AND :post_end\\n  GROUP BY s.series_id\\n),\\nmarket AS (\\n  SELECT SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :pre_start AND :pre_end THEN vv ELSE 0 END) AS mkt_vv_pre,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :post_start AND :post_end THEN vv ELSE 0 END) AS mkt_vv_post\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :pre_start AND :post_end\\n)\\nSELECT sp.series_id, se.series_name, sp.vv_pre, sp.vv_post,\\n  ROUND((sp.vv_post-sp.vv_pre)/NULLIF(sp.vv_pre,0)*100,2) AS vv_change_pct,\\n  ROUND(sp.fin_pre/NULLIF(sp.vv_pre,0)*100,2) AS finish_rate_pre_pct,\\n  ROUND(sp.fin_post/NULLIF(sp.vv_post,0)*100,2) AS finish_rate_post_pct,\\n  ROUND((sp.fin_post/NULLIF(sp.vv_post,0)-sp.fin_pre/NULLIF(sp.vv_pre,0))*100,2) AS finish_rate_diff_pct,\\n  ROUND((m.mkt_vv_post-m.mkt_vv_pre)/NULLIF(m.mkt_vv_pre,0)*100,2) AS market_vv_change_pct,\\n  ROUND(((sp.vv_post-sp.vv_pre)/NULLIF(sp.vv_pre,0)*100)-((m.mkt_vv_post-m.mkt_vv_pre)/NULLIF(m.mkt_vv_pre,0)*100),2) AS excess_vv_change_pct\\nFROM series_period sp\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_content_series se ON sp.series_id=se.series_id\\nCROSS JOIN market m\\nWHERE sp.vv_pre>0 OR sp.vv_post>0\\nORDER BY sp.vv_post DESC LIMIT 50;", "judge": "excess>0 → 跑赢大盘；≤0 → 不得归因改版；完播差<-3pct → 查内容/推荐", "output": "内容效果评估表"}, {"title": "点播渗透（去重 MAC）", "desc": "修正行数分母：按 MAC 月内是否点播活跃算渗透差。", "sql": "WITH user_month AS (\\n  SELECT mac,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')=DATE_FORMAT(:pre_end,''%Y-%m'') THEN is_vod_active ELSE 0 END) AS vod_pre,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')=DATE_FORMAT(:post_end,''%Y-%m'') THEN is_vod_active ELSE 0 END) AS vod_post\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :pre_start AND :post_end\\n  GROUP BY mac\\n)\\nSELECT ROUND(AVG(vod_pre)*100,2) AS vod_penetration_pre_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(vod_post)*100,2) AS vod_penetration_post_pct,\\n  ROUND((AVG(vod_post)-AVG(vod_pre))*100,2) AS vod_penetration_diff_pct\\nFROM user_month;", "judge": "渗透差与超额同向 → 整体正贡献；反方向 → 可能挤占其他内容", "output": "点播渗透变化"}], "outputs": ["内容效果评估表（含大盘/超额）", "改版效应结论", "加推/调整建议"], "nextSteps": ["excess>10%且完播未降 → 「产品优先级优化」加推", "excess>0但完播降>3pct → 「完播率异常诊断」", "excess≤0 → 不加推，排查大盘因素", "渗透与超额反方向 → 检查内容挤占"], "dashboards": ["内容·剧集", "series", "点播活跃", "vod"]}, {"id": "q22", "layer": "l4", "category": "活动效果类", "title": "活动 ROI 评估（订购分成）", "desc": "ROI=增量分成/活动成本(K21)；反事实趋势外推拆增量；禁止把分成率当 ROI", "bizQuestion": "这次活动 ROI 怎么样？下轮要不要继续做？", "keywords": ["ROI", "活动", "增量分成", "反事实", "套餐"], "triggers": ["暑期促销结束后", "连续包月优惠活动复盘", "月度分成结算前"], "criteria": [{"dim": "活动 ROI", "ok": ">1.2 可放大", "warn": "0.8–1.2 维持", "bad": "<0.8 复盘"}, {"dim": "增量分成", "ok": ">0", "warn": "接近0", "bad": "≤0 活动无效"}], "steps": [{"title": "评估前置四件事", "desc": "活动期 vs 基线期同长度；须增量拆分；revenue_share=平台分成；成本取 dwd_activity_cost_1d；订单<500标样本偏少。", "output": "基线/反事实/口径/样本声明"}, {"title": "活动期 vs 基线期", "desc": "参数化窗口；对比订单/分成/分成率（分成率≠ROI）。", "sql": "WITH base AS (\\n  SELECT SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(order_amount) AS amount, SUM(revenue_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :base_start AND :base_end\\n),\\nact AS (\\n  SELECT SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(order_amount) AS amount, SUM(revenue_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end\\n)\\nSELECT b.orders AS base_orders, a.orders AS act_orders,\\n  ROUND((a.orders-b.orders)/NULLIF(b.orders,0)*100,2) AS orders_change_pct,\\n  b.share AS base_share, a.share AS act_share,\\n  ROUND((a.share-b.share)/NULLIF(b.share,0)*100,2) AS share_change_pct,\\n  ROUND(b.share/NULLIF(b.amount,0)*100,2) AS base_share_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(a.share/NULLIF(a.amount,0)*100,2) AS act_share_rate_pct\\nFROM base b CROSS JOIN act a;", "judge": "订单增但分成未增 → 低分成套餐拉量；分成率降>2pct → 查套餐结构", "output": "活动期 vs 基线对比表"}, {"title": "增量拆分（反事实趋势外推）", "desc": "基线期拟合线性趋势外推活动期；incremental=实际-反事实。", "sql": "WITH daily AS (\\n  SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(revenue_share) AS share,\\n    DATEDIFF(snapshot_date, :base_start) AS t\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :base_start AND :act_end\\n  GROUP BY snapshot_date\\n),\\nfit AS (\\n  SELECT\\n    (AVG(t*orders)-AVG(t)*AVG(orders))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0) AS slope_orders,\\n    AVG(orders)-((AVG(t*orders)-AVG(t)*AVG(orders))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0))*AVG(t) AS intercept_orders,\\n    (AVG(t*share)-AVG(t)*AVG(share))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0) AS slope_share,\\n    AVG(share)-((AVG(t*share)-AVG(t)*AVG(share))/NULLIF(AVG(t*t)-AVG(t)*AVG(t),0))*AVG(t) AS intercept_share\\n  FROM daily WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :base_start AND :base_end\\n)\\nSELECT\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN orders ELSE 0 END),0) AS actual_orders,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN (f.intercept_orders+f.slope_orders*t) ELSE 0 END),0) AS counterfactual_orders,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN orders ELSE 0 END)\\n    -SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN (f.intercept_orders+f.slope_orders*t) ELSE 0 END),0) AS incremental_orders,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN share ELSE 0 END),0) AS actual_share,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN (f.intercept_share+f.slope_share*t) ELSE 0 END),0) AS counterfactual_share,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN share ELSE 0 END)\\n    -SUM(CASE WHEN snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end THEN (f.intercept_share+f.slope_share*t) ELSE 0 END),0) AS incremental_share\\nFROM daily d CROSS JOIN fit f\\nWHERE d.snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end;", "judge": "incremental_share≤0 → 无增量分成，活动无效", "output": "增量订单/分成"}, {"title": "活动 ROI（增量分成/成本）", "desc": "ROI=incremental_share/活动成本；成本表缺失则注明待补、不得硬下 ROI 结论。", "sql": "SELECT SUM(cost_amount) AS total_cost\\nFROM internet_analytics.dwd_activity_cost_1d\\nWHERE stat_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end AND activity_id=:activity_id;\\n-- activity_roi = incremental_share / NULLIF(total_cost,0)", "judge": "ROI<0.8 复盘；0.8–1.2 维持；>1.2 可放大", "output": "活动 ROI"}, {"title": "套餐结构贡献（含基线）", "desc": "活动期 vs 基线期按 pay_type 对比。", "sql": "WITH base AS (\\n  SELECT pay_type, SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(revenue_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :base_start AND :base_end GROUP BY pay_type\\n),\\nact AS (\\n  SELECT pay_type, SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(revenue_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :act_start AND :act_end GROUP BY pay_type\\n)\\nSELECT a.pay_type, b.orders AS base_orders, a.orders AS act_orders,\\n  ROUND((a.orders-b.orders)/NULLIF(b.orders,0)*100,2) AS orders_change_pct,\\n  b.share AS base_share, a.share AS act_share,\\n  ROUND((a.share-b.share)/NULLIF(b.share,0)*100,2) AS share_change_pct\\nFROM act a LEFT JOIN base b ON a.pay_type=b.pay_type\\nORDER BY a.orders DESC;", "judge": "订单高但分成低 → 调优惠；分成显著正 → 加大该套餐推广", "output": "套餐贡献对比"}], "outputs": ["活动 ROI 评估表", "套餐结构贡献对比", "评估结论三要素"], "nextSteps": ["ROI<0.8且增量分成为正 → 「定价策略优化」", "ROI<0.8且增量分成≤0 → 下轮不做", "ROI>1.2且某套餐突出 → 加大该套餐推广", "反事实不可用 → 标评估效力有限，不进入决策"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "dws_trade_order_1d"]}, {"id": "q23", "layer": "l4", "category": "体验评估类", "title": "用户满意度评估（完播/QoS 代理）", "desc": "主指标加权完播(K13)；修正行为 SQL；联动 QoS；无相关性证据不得称满意度(K22)", "bizQuestion": "用户满意度怎么样？体验在变好还是变差？", "keywords": ["满意度", "完播率", "QoS", "卡顿", "代理有效性"], "triggers": ["QoS 投诉上升", "完播率月环比下降", "NPS 调研前需数据支撑"], "criteria": [{"dim": "加权完播", "ok": "≥45%且较基线未降>5pct", "warn": "接近阈值", "bad": "<45%或降>5pct"}, {"dim": "卡顿环比", "ok": "平稳", "warn": "升≈2pct", "bad": ">2pct 且完播降"}], "steps": [{"title": "评估前置四件事", "desc": "近3月或上月作基线并声明；排除内容排期干扰；K22：无 NPS-完播相关性则只能称观看体验相关指标；须分题材看。", "output": "基线/代理有效性声明"}, {"title": "加权完播 vs 基线", "desc": "主指标=加权完播；非加权剧集均值仅参考。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT ROUND(SUM(finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(vv),0)*100,2) AS weighted_finish_rate_pct,\\n    ROUND(AVG(complete_rate_avg),2) AS avg_series_complete_rate, SUM(vv) AS total_vv\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n),\\nbase AS (\\n  SELECT ROUND(SUM(finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(vv),0)*100,2) AS baseline_weighted_finish_rate_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n)\\nSELECT c.weighted_finish_rate_pct, c.avg_series_complete_rate, c.total_vv,\\n  b.baseline_weighted_finish_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.weighted_finish_rate_pct-b.baseline_weighted_finish_rate_pct,2) AS diff_pct\\nFROM cur c CROSS JOIN base b;", "judge": "加权完播<45%或diff<-5pct → 关注；加权与非加权差>10pct → 分剧集看", "output": "满意度代理 KPI"}, {"title": "播放行为分布", "desc": "查 dwd_vod_play_di 的 pause/seek/stop；表不存在则注明待补并跳过。", "sql": "SELECT DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') AS ym,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''play'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS play_cnt,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''pause'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS pause_cnt,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''seek'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS seek_cnt,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''stop'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS stop_cnt,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''pause'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/NULLIF(SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''play'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END),0),2) AS pause_per_play,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''seek'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/NULLIF(SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''play'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END),0),2) AS seek_per_play,\\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''stop'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/NULLIF(SUM(CASE WHEN event_type=''play'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END),0),2) AS stop_per_play\\nFROM internet_analytics.dwd_vod_play_di\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') ORDER BY ym;", "judge": "pause/seek/stop per play 环比升>20% → 体验或流失前兆", "output": "播放行为分布"}, {"title": "QoS 联动", "desc": "若存在 dws_qos_play_quality_1d 则对比首帧/卡顿/失败率；否则注明无法区分内容/体验。", "sql": "WITH cur AS (\\n  SELECT ROUND(AVG(first_frame_ms),0) AS avg_first_frame_ms,\\n    ROUND(AVG(stutter_rate_pct),2) AS avg_stutter_rate_pct,\\n    ROUND(AVG(play_fail_rate_pct),2) AS avg_play_fail_rate_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_qos_play_quality_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n),\\nbase AS (\\n  SELECT ROUND(AVG(first_frame_ms),0) AS base_first_frame_ms,\\n    ROUND(AVG(stutter_rate_pct),2) AS base_stutter_rate_pct,\\n    ROUND(AVG(play_fail_rate_pct),2) AS base_play_fail_rate_pct\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_qos_play_quality_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 3 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n)\\nSELECT c.avg_first_frame_ms, b.base_first_frame_ms,\\n  ROUND(c.avg_first_frame_ms-b.base_first_frame_ms,0) AS diff_first_frame_ms,\\n  c.avg_stutter_rate_pct, b.base_stutter_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.avg_stutter_rate_pct-b.base_stutter_rate_pct,2) AS diff_stutter_pct,\\n  c.avg_play_fail_rate_pct, b.base_play_fail_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(c.avg_play_fail_rate_pct-b.base_play_fail_rate_pct,2) AS diff_play_fail_pct\\nFROM cur c CROSS JOIN base b;", "judge": "卡顿升>2pct且完播降 → QoS；首帧升>20% → 关注体验；QoS平稳完播降 → 转q13", "output": "QoS diff"}, {"title": "代理有效性（K22）", "desc": "有 NPS-完播相关性(如r>0.5)才可称满意度代理；否则改称观看体验相关指标。", "output": "代理有效性说明"}], "outputs": ["满意度代理 KPI（加权完播+基线+diff）", "播放行为分布（若可用）", "QoS 三项+diff", "代理有效性说明", "体验改进优先级"], "nextSteps": ["卡顿/首帧恶化且完播降 → 「完播与QoS」看板", "QoS平稳但完播降 → 「完播率异常诊断」", "pause/seek/stop环比升>20% → 播放行为专项排查", "无相关性证据 → 表述改为观看体验相关指标"], "dashboards": ["完播与QoS", "quality", "内容·单集与行为", "episode"]}, {"id": "q24", "layer": "l5", "category": "投放优化类", "title": "投放预算分配优化（入口流量）", "desc": "按 LTV/CAC 与边际 ROI 倾斜分配；约束下三方案对比，禁止用平均效率拍占比", "bizQuestion": "预算应该怎么分配？加码哪个入口、收缩哪个、加多少？", "keywords": ["预算", "分配", "边际ROI", "入口", "流量", "灰度"], "triggers": ["季度预算调整", "某入口 LTV/CAC >3 需加码", "video 误触导致浪费"], "criteria": [{"dim": "边际 ROI", "ok": ">1.5 可加码", "warn": "1–1.5 小幅倾斜", "bad": "<1 不加码"}, {"dim": "预期增量/成本", "ok": ">1.5 可执行", "warn": "接近1.5", "bad": "<1.5 维持现状"}], "steps": [{"title": "决策前置四件事", "desc": "目标=最大化总增量分成或总LTV/CAC；约束=总预算/单入口上下限/依赖度≤60%；方案≥维持现状+边际倾斜+保守倾斜；验证=小流量灰度，回滚条件边际ROI<1。", "output": "目标/约束/方案集/验证声明"}, {"title": "入口效率排序（补 CAC）", "desc": "同窗口合并 v_ltv、成本、新客，按 LTV/CAC 排序。", "sql": "WITH ltv AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(avg_platform_share) AS total_share, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS user_cnt\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n),\\ncost AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS total_cost FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nnewu AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS new_users FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT l.channel_code, l.user_cnt, n.new_users,\\n  ROUND(l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0),2) AS ltv_per_user,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),2) AS cac,\\n  ROUND((l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0))/NULLIF(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),0),2) AS ltv_cac_ratio,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost/NULLIF(l.total_share,0),2) AS cost_to_share_ratio\\nFROM ltv l\\nLEFT JOIN cost c ON l.channel_code=c.channel_code\\nLEFT JOIN newu n ON l.channel_code=n.channel_code\\nORDER BY ltv_cac_ratio DESC;", "output": "入口效率排序表"}, {"title": "边际效率估计（K25）", "desc": "近6月分月花费/分成，用环比增量估 marginal_roi；分配用边际而非平均。", "sql": "WITH monthly AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, DATE_FORMAT(stat_date,''%Y-%m'') AS ym, SUM(cost_amount) AS cost\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 6 MONTH) AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY channel_code, DATE_FORMAT(stat_date,''%Y-%m'')\\n),\\nrev AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'') AS ym, SUM(avg_platform_share) AS share\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 6 MONTH) AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY channel_name, DATE_FORMAT(snapshot_date,''%Y-%m'')\\n),\\njoined AS (\\n  SELECT m.channel_code, m.ym, m.cost, r.share,\\n    LAG(m.cost) OVER (PARTITION BY m.channel_code ORDER BY m.ym) AS prev_cost,\\n    LAG(r.share) OVER (PARTITION BY m.channel_code ORDER BY m.ym) AS prev_share\\n  FROM monthly m LEFT JOIN rev r ON m.channel_code=r.channel_code AND m.ym=r.ym\\n)\\nSELECT channel_code,\\n  ROUND(AVG((share-prev_share)/NULLIF(cost-prev_cost,0)),2) AS marginal_roi_avg,\\n  ROUND(AVG(share/NULLIF(cost,0)),2) AS avg_roi\\nFROM joined WHERE prev_cost IS NOT NULL AND cost>prev_cost\\nGROUP BY channel_code ORDER BY marginal_roi_avg DESC;", "judge": "marginal_roi<1 → 不加码；明显低于avg_roi → 接近饱和；高于avg_roi → 仍有加码空间", "output": "边际效率表"}, {"title": "预算分配算法（约束倾斜）", "desc": "方案A维持现状；B按边际ROI权重分配并截断依赖度上限；C仅对边际ROI>1.5小幅加码。", "sql": "SELECT touch_point, SUM(attributed_orders) AS orders,\\n  ROUND(SUM(attributed_orders)/SUM(SUM(attributed_orders)) OVER()*100,2) AS current_share_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(attributed_amount)/NULLIF(SUM(attributed_orders),0),2) AS avg_order_value\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_channel_attribution\\nWHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY touch_point;", "judge": "须满足单入口依赖度≤60%及预算上下限；预期增量分成=ΣΔ预算×边际ROI", "output": "三方案对比 + 当前占比基线"}, {"title": "验证与回滚（K30）", "desc": "方案B先10%流量灰度2–4周；边际ROI<1或CAC环比升>15% → 回滚方案A。", "output": "灰度计划 + 回滚条件"}], "outputs": ["入口效率排序表", "边际效率表", "三方案对比（预算比例/预期增量/风险）", "推荐方案+验证+回滚"], "nextSteps": ["预期增量/成本>1.5且验证通过 → 执行灰度", "灰度期边际ROI<1或CAC环比升>15% → 回滚方案A", "某入口LTV/CAC<1且边际ROI<1 → 「渠道组合优化」", "预期增量/成本<1.5 → 维持现状"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "商业化漏斗", "funnel"]}, {"id": "q25", "layer": "l5", "category": "用户挽回类", "title": "用户挽回策略优化", "desc": "RFM 最新快照分层；分层策略矩阵 + 挽回 ROI；分层对照验证，禁止无日期 COUNT 虚高", "bizQuestion": "怎么挽回流失用户？挽回值不值？先挽回谁？", "keywords": ["挽回", "RFM", "挽回ROI", "触达", "分层对照"], "triggers": ["沉默用户占比 >20%", "churn_cnt 连续上升", "续订率下滑"], "criteria": [{"dim": "挽回 ROI", "ok": ">1 可扩大", "warn": "接近1", "bad": "<1 不启动大规模"}, {"dim": "历史挽回成功率", "ok": ">15% 优先", "warn": "5–15%", "bad": "<5% 低成本或放弃"}], "steps": [{"title": "决策前置四件事", "desc": "目标=最大化挽回增量留存价值或挽回ROI；约束=触达预算/频次/合规；方案≥不挽回+只高价值+分层全量；验证=分层随机对照。", "output": "目标/约束/方案集/验证声明"}, {"title": "RFM 分层分布（补快照日期）", "desc": "仅取最新 snapshot_date，COUNT DISTINCT mac。", "sql": "SELECT rfm_segment, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS users,\\n  ROUND(COUNT(DISTINCT mac)/SUM(COUNT(DISTINCT mac)) OVER()*100,2) AS share_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(days_since_last_active),1) AS avg_days_since_active\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_rfm\\nWHERE snapshot_date=(SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm)\\nGROUP BY rfm_segment ORDER BY users DESC;", "output": "RFM 分层分布表"}, {"title": "分层策略 + 历史挽回成功率", "desc": "高价值沉默→人工/权益；一般沉默→push；流失风险→内容推荐；用历史30日再激活率估 ROI。", "sql": "WITH hist AS (\\n  SELECT r.mac, r.rfm_segment,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN a.snapshot_date > r.snapshot_date THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS reactivated\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm r\\n  LEFT JOIN internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d a\\n    ON r.mac=a.mac AND a.snapshot_date BETWEEN r.snapshot_date + INTERVAL 1 DAY AND r.snapshot_date + INTERVAL 30 DAY\\n  WHERE r.snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 6 MONTH) AND DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 1 DAY)\\n  GROUP BY r.mac, r.rfm_segment\\n)\\nSELECT rfm_segment, COUNT(*) AS users, ROUND(AVG(reactivated)*100,2) AS reactivation_rate_pct\\nFROM hist GROUP BY rfm_segment;", "judge": "成功率<5% → 大概率ROI<1不大规模触达；>15% → 优先且可用更高成本", "output": "分层策略矩阵 + 成功率"}, {"title": "分层人群清单", "desc": "按分层输出名单与策略，上限由触达预算决定（禁止随意 LIMIT 100）。", "sql": "SELECT mac AS user_id, rfm_segment, days_since_last_active,\\n  CASE WHEN rfm_segment=''高价值沉默'' THEN ''人工/权益召回''\\n       WHEN rfm_segment=''一般沉默'' THEN ''push/短信''\\n       WHEN rfm_segment=''流失风险'' THEN ''内容推荐/push''\\n       ELSE ''低成本触达或放弃'' END AS strategy\\nFROM internet_analytics.v_rfm\\nWHERE snapshot_date=(SELECT MAX(snapshot_date) FROM internet_analytics.v_rfm)\\n  AND rfm_segment IN (''高价值沉默'',''一般沉默'',''流失风险'')\\nORDER BY CASE rfm_segment WHEN ''高价值沉默'' THEN 1 WHEN ''一般沉默'' THEN 2 ELSE 3 END,\\n  days_since_last_active DESC;", "output": "分层人群清单"}, {"title": "挽回实验设计（K30）", "desc": "层内随机触达 vs 不触达；观察30日增量留存/分成；退订升>5pct或投诉升>2pct立即停止。", "output": "实验设计 + 回滚条件"}], "outputs": ["RFM 分层分布", "分层策略矩阵", "挽回 ROI 估算", "人群清单 + 实验设计"], "nextSteps": ["某层挽回ROI>1且实验有效 → 扩大该层触达", "某层ROI<1 → 不启动或仅低成本", "触达后退订/投诉超阈值 → 立即停止", "L3预测下月流失升>20% → 扩大预算前先复核ROI"], "dashboards": ["用户生命周期", "lifecycle", "v_rfm"]}, {"id": "q26", "layer": "l5", "category": "产品优先级类", "title": "产品优先级优化", "desc": "RICE/四象限 + 去重 MAC 渗透缺口 + 战略权重；三方案对比与验证闭环", "bizQuestion": "先做哪个功能/内容？资源有限怎么取舍？", "keywords": ["优先级", "RICE", "渗透缺口", "战略权重", "roadmap"], "triggers": ["季度产品 roadmap 评审", "资源有限需取舍", "某功能渗透低但战略重要"], "criteria": [{"dim": "渗透缺口", "ok": "缺口大且战略权重大", "warn": "中等", "bad": "缺口小或投入过高"}, {"dim": "预期增量/成本", "ok": ">1.5", "warn": "接近", "bad": "<1.5 维持现状"}], "steps": [{"title": "决策前置四件事", "desc": "目标=单位投入增量价值(VV/完播/渗透×战略权重)；约束=人力/采购预算/上线窗；方案含维持现状；验证=内容用L4超额、功能用A/B。", "output": "目标/约束/方案集/验证声明"}, {"title": "内容价值矩阵 + RICE 输入", "desc": "VV/UV/加权完播/品类；RICE=(Reach×Impact×Confidence)/Effort。", "sql": "SELECT s.series_id, se.series_name, g.genre_name,\\n  SUM(s.vv) AS vv, SUM(s.uv) AS uv,\\n  ROUND(SUM(s.finish_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(s.vv),0)*100,2) AS weighted_finish_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(AVG(s.complete_rate_avg),2) AS avg_series_complete_rate\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_content_series_play_1d s\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_content_series se ON s.series_id=se.series_id\\nJOIN internet_analytics.dim_genre g ON s.genre_id=g.genre_id\\nWHERE s.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY s.series_id, se.series_name, g.genre_name\\nORDER BY vv DESC LIMIT 50;", "judge": "高VV低完播→优化体验；低VV高完播→加推；双高→维持复用；双低→下架", "output": "内容价值矩阵"}, {"title": "功能渗透缺口（去重 MAC）", "desc": "禁止行数分母；按 MAC 月内 MAX 活跃标志算渗透。", "sql": "WITH user_month AS (\\n  SELECT mac, MAX(is_vod_active) AS is_vod_user, MAX(is_live_active) AS is_live_user,\\n    MAX(is_only_launcher) AS is_only_launcher_user\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_act_user_active_1d\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY mac\\n)\\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS monthly_active_mac,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_vod_user)/COUNT(*)*100,2) AS vod_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_live_user)/COUNT(*)*100,2) AS live_penetration_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(is_only_launcher_user)/COUNT(*)*100,2) AS only_launcher_pct\\nFROM user_month;", "judge": "点播<70%/直播<38% → 功能缺口提优先级；only_launcher>35% → 优先引导开机到播放", "output": "功能渗透缺口表"}, {"title": "功能 RICE + 战略权重（K28）", "desc": "priority≈缺口×战略权重/人天；权重与投入由业务维表维护。", "sql": "SELECT feature_name, penetration_pct, (benchmark_pct-penetration_pct) AS gap_pct,\\n  strategic_weight, effort_person_days,\\n  ROUND((benchmark_pct-penetration_pct)*strategic_weight/NULLIF(effort_person_days,0),2) AS priority_score\\nFROM (\\n  SELECT ''vod'' AS feature_name, 0 AS penetration_pct, 80 AS benchmark_pct, 3 AS strategic_weight, 20 AS effort_person_days\\n  UNION ALL SELECT ''live'', 0, 40, 2, 15\\n  UNION ALL SELECT ''launcher_guide'', 0, 30, 3, 10\\n) t;", "output": "RICE/优先级得分表"}, {"title": "三方案对比与验证", "desc": "A维持roadmap；B按RICE TopN；C战略优先；内容→L4 q21，功能→L4 q20。", "output": "推荐方案 + 验证/回滚"}], "outputs": ["内容价值矩阵", "功能渗透缺口", "RICE打分表", "三方案对比与验证"], "nextSteps": ["含内容加推且增量/成本>1.5 → 「产品功能效果评估」", "体验优化且完播低 → 「完播率异常诊断」", "缺口大且战略权重大 → 「A/B测试效果评估」", "RICE争议大 → 先小规模实验再排序"], "dashboards": ["内容·剧集", "series", "点播活跃", "vod", "直播活跃", "live"]}, {"id": "q27", "layer": "l5", "category": "渠道组合类", "title": "渠道组合优化", "desc": "多触点协同 + LTV/CAC/D7/依赖度；分散依赖与收缩低效三方案，灰度验证", "bizQuestion": "入口怎么组合最优？单入口依赖是否过高？", "keywords": ["渠道组合", "协同", "依赖度", "LTV/CAC", "D7"], "triggers": ["单入口依赖度过高", "多渠道触点需协同", "归因模型切换评估"], "criteria": [{"dim": "依赖度", "ok": "≤60%", "warn": "接近60%", "bad": ">60% 触发分散"}, {"dim": "LTV/CAC×D7", "ok": ">2且留存高", "warn": "1–2", "bad": "<1且留存低收缩"}], "steps": [{"title": "决策前置四件事", "desc": "目标=最大化总分成/组合LTV/CAC并控依赖度；约束=依赖度≤60%/保底预算/合同；方案≥维持+分散+收缩低效；验证=分地区灰度。", "output": "目标/约束/方案集/验证声明"}, {"title": "入口贡献与协同", "desc": "multi_touch vs single_touch 的 ARPU/人均订单。", "sql": "WITH user_touch AS (\\n  SELECT mac, COUNT(DISTINCT touch_point) AS touch_cnt,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN touch_point=''launcher'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_launcher,\\n    MAX(CASE WHEN touch_point=''video'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_video\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_channel_attribution\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY mac\\n),\\nuser_order AS (\\n  SELECT mac, SUM(attributed_amount) AS amount, SUM(attributed_orders) AS orders\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_channel_attribution\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY mac\\n)\\nSELECT CASE WHEN t.touch_cnt=1 THEN ''single_touch'' ELSE ''multi_touch'' END AS touch_group,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT t.mac) AS users,\\n  ROUND(SUM(o.amount)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT t.mac),0),2) AS arpu,\\n  ROUND(SUM(o.orders)/NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT t.mac),0),2) AS orders_per_user\\nFROM user_touch t LEFT JOIN user_order o ON t.mac=o.mac\\nGROUP BY CASE WHEN t.touch_cnt=1 THEN ''single_touch'' ELSE ''multi_touch'' END;", "judge": "multi_touch ARPU高>20% → 有协同；≤single → 查归因口径", "output": "协同分析表"}, {"title": "组合效率（补 CAC/D7/依赖度）", "desc": "同窗口 LTV/CAC + D7 留存 + 分成依赖度。", "sql": "WITH ltv AS (\\n  SELECT channel_name AS channel_code, SUM(avg_platform_share) AS total_share, COUNT(DISTINCT mac) AS user_cnt\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_ltv\\n  WHERE snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_name\\n),\\ncost AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(cost_amount) AS total_cost FROM internet_analytics.dwd_marketing_cost_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nnewu AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, SUM(new_user_cnt) AS new_users FROM internet_analytics.dws_channel_new_user_1d\\n  WHERE stat_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n),\\nretention AS (\\n  SELECT channel_code, ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN day_offset=7 THEN retention_rate END),2) AS d7_retention\\n  FROM internet_analytics.v_user_retention\\n  WHERE cohort_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end GROUP BY channel_code\\n)\\nSELECT l.channel_code, l.user_cnt, n.new_users,\\n  ROUND(l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0),2) AS ltv_per_user,\\n  ROUND(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),2) AS cac,\\n  ROUND((l.total_share/NULLIF(l.user_cnt,0))/NULLIF(c.total_cost/NULLIF(n.new_users,0),0),2) AS ltv_cac_ratio,\\n  r.d7_retention,\\n  ROUND(l.total_share/SUM(l.total_share) OVER()*100,2) AS dependency_pct\\nFROM ltv l\\nLEFT JOIN cost c ON l.channel_code=c.channel_code\\nLEFT JOIN newu n ON l.channel_code=n.channel_code\\nLEFT JOIN retention r ON l.channel_code=r.channel_code\\nORDER BY ltv_cac_ratio DESC;", "judge": "LTV/CAC>2且D7高→加大；<1且D7低→收缩；dependency>60%→分散", "output": "组合效率对比表"}, {"title": "组合方案 + 验证", "desc": "A维持；B高依赖降10pct匀给次优；C低效入口降至保底；灰度4周，总分成降>10%或依赖仍>60%回滚。", "output": "三方案对比 + 灰度/回滚"}], "outputs": ["协同分析表", "组合效率对比表", "三方案对比", "预期收益/风险/验证"], "nextSteps": ["推荐方案预算落地 → 「投放预算分配优化」", "multi_touch ARPU高>20% → 组合投放实验(L4 q20)", "依赖仍>60%或总分成降>10% → 回滚重评", "归因存疑 → 工具箱「渠道归因分析」"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "v_channel_attribution", "v_ltv"]}, {"id": "q28", "layer": "l5", "category": "定价优化类", "title": "定价策略优化", "desc": "套餐结构风险 + 价格弹性系数 + 利润模型；必须 A/B，禁止只看客单趋势当弹性", "bizQuestion": "套餐价格怎么定？结构怎么调？该不该降价/加权益？", "keywords": ["定价", "弹性", "套餐", "毛利", "退订", "A/B"], "triggers": ["客单下降或续订率下滑", "竞品定价调整", "新套餐上线评估"], "criteria": [{"dim": "退订率", "ok": "≤15%", "warn": "接近15%", "bad": ">15% 需复盘"}, {"dim": "|弹性|", "ok": ">1 可考虑降价拉量", "warn": "≈1", "bad": "<1 降价不划算→加权益"}], "steps": [{"title": "决策前置四件事", "desc": "目标=总收入或总利润(分成-内容成本-让利)；约束=最低价/成本率/竞品带/退订上限；方案≥维持现价+降价X%+加权益不降价；验证必须A/B。", "output": "目标/约束/方案集/验证声明"}, {"title": "套餐结构分析", "desc": "补收入占比/结构风险；参数化窗口。", "sql": "SELECT pay_type, SUM(order_cnt) AS orders, SUM(unsub_cnt) AS unsub,\\n  ROUND(SUM(order_amount),0) AS amount, ROUND(SUM(revenue_share),0) AS share,\\n  ROUND(SUM(order_amount)/NULLIF(SUM(order_cnt),0),2) AS avg_price,\\n  ROUND(SUM(unsub_cnt)/NULLIF(SUM(order_cnt),0)*100,2) AS unsub_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(revenue_share)/SUM(SUM(revenue_share)) OVER()*100,2) AS share_contribution_pct\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\nWHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY pay_type ORDER BY orders DESC;", "judge": "收入占比>50%→结构风险；退订>15%→复盘；均价降>10%且订单未升→降价未拉量", "output": "套餐结构表"}, {"title": "价格弹性估计（K29）", "desc": "elasticity=订购量变化率/价格变化率；仅取价格变动>5%时点。", "sql": "WITH price_change AS (\\n  SELECT pay_type, snapshot_date, SUM(order_cnt) AS orders,\\n    SUM(order_amount)/NULLIF(SUM(order_cnt),0) AS avg_price\\n  FROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d\\n  WHERE src_type<>''ALL'' AND snapshot_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(:month_start, INTERVAL 12 MONTH) AND :month_end\\n  GROUP BY pay_type, snapshot_date\\n),\\nlagged AS (\\n  SELECT pay_type, snapshot_date, orders, avg_price,\\n    LAG(orders) OVER (PARTITION BY pay_type ORDER BY snapshot_date) AS prev_orders,\\n    LAG(avg_price) OVER (PARTITION BY pay_type ORDER BY snapshot_date) AS prev_price\\n  FROM price_change\\n)\\nSELECT pay_type,\\n  ROUND(AVG((orders-prev_orders)/NULLIF(prev_orders,0)/NULLIF((avg_price-prev_price)/NULLIF(prev_price,0),0)),2) AS elasticity\\nFROM lagged\\nWHERE prev_price IS NOT NULL AND ABS((avg_price-prev_price)/NULLIF(prev_price,0))>0.05\\nGROUP BY pay_type;", "judge": "|e|>1 → 降价能拉量但需算收入；|e|<1 → 降价不划算；e>0 → 数据异常排查", "output": "价格弹性表"}, {"title": "套餐利润模型", "desc": "毛利≈分成×(1-内容成本率)；成本率来自业务维表 dim_pay_type_cost。", "sql": "SELECT o.pay_type, SUM(o.revenue_share) AS revenue_share, SUM(o.order_amount) AS order_amount,\\n  ROUND(SUM(o.revenue_share)/NULLIF(SUM(o.order_amount),0)*100,2) AS share_rate_pct,\\n  MAX(c.content_cost_rate_pct) AS content_cost_rate_pct,\\n  ROUND(SUM(o.revenue_share)*(1-MAX(c.content_cost_rate_pct)/100),0) AS gross_profit\\nFROM internet_analytics.dws_trade_order_1d o\\nLEFT JOIN internet_analytics.dim_pay_type_cost c ON o.pay_type=c.pay_type\\nWHERE o.src_type<>''ALL'' AND o.snapshot_date BETWEEN :month_start AND :month_end\\nGROUP BY o.pay_type ORDER BY gross_profit DESC;", "judge": "毛利占比低订单高→低利润拉量需上调或降权益；毛利高订单少→可加大推广", "output": "套餐利润模型"}, {"title": "定价方案 + A/B（K30）", "desc": "A维持；B对|e|>1降价；C对|e|<1加权益不降价；必须A/B；退订升>5pct或毛利降>10%回滚。", "output": "三方案对比 + A/B与回滚"}], "outputs": ["套餐结构表", "价格弹性表", "利润模型", "三方案对比 + A/B验证"], "nextSteps": ["推荐方案进A/B → 「A/B测试效果评估」", "预期收入变化 → 「分成收入预测」", "退订升>5pct或毛利降>10% → 回滚重评", "结构风险>50% → 设计套餐分散方案"], "dashboards": ["订购与分成", "order", "dws_trade_order_1d"]}], "playbook_count": 28, "sidebar_note": "左侧导航展示六层框架（l1-l5 问题列表 + l6 工具箱入口）"}, "statistics": {"dashboard_count": 18, "theme_dashboard_count": 17, "playbook_count": 28, "toolbox_method_count": 15, "analysis_layers": 6}}' AS JSON)
FROM industry_catalog ic
WHERE ic.industry_code = 'internet'
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
    release_notes = VALUES(release_notes),
    status = VALUES(status),
    config_json = VALUES(config_json),
    created_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;

UPDATE industry_catalog
SET current_version = 'v2.21', updated_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
WHERE industry_code = 'internet';

INSERT INTO change_log (industry_id, component_type, component_name, change_type, new_value, change_reason)
SELECT ic.industry_id, 'config', 'portfolio_snapshot', 'modify', 'v2.21', 'L1 pending-fix: strict only-launcher, MAC x device, 7d wow SQL, remove unpaid MAC estimate, new/old split guards, seg reconcile, category finish ratio'
FROM industry_catalog ic WHERE ic.industry_code = 'internet';
